<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet (Word 4Z World)</book>
  <para style="h">Mark'os Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark'os Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mark'os Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar.</para>
  <para style="mt">Mark'os Guut'tso</para>
  <para style="mt3">Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark'os doo shishiyo, «Han Ik'o naay Iyesus Krstos doo shishyo b́ tuwokoniye» etona b́tuu, dooshishiyanitse Iyesus fini ashonat naash wotatni b́t'in. Bí alonwere b́daniyonat fo'erawwotsatse b́ detsts angonat ash na'i morro oorowe bí eton be'ere. Iyesus «Ashuwotsi morr finosh guuts wototse kishosh t kasho beshi de'er ímosh waats Ash Na'o taane» ett b́tookon keewre.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark'os Iyesus jango b́t'intswere kaawonat angon s'een b́wotts weeron wotat b́t'iwintswere Iyesus aap'onat b́daniyats b́ woterawo b́fiints adits finwotsatsa b́tesh. Gupfo Yohans jangonat, Iyesus gupewon bíyats bodts fadewo k'awintsdek' b́ ími hakon guut'tsman Iyesus daniyonat kashiyon gawintsdek' b́keewi. Múk'i b́teshihakon Iyesus shuutso shoydek't shaiirwots Iyesusi iki bogshdek't danfere boami taawo Iyesusi k'efirwots iki bogshdek't bín shit'fera boam. Mas'afahan s'uwaatsi k'ot'wotsitse fa'uwots Iyesus beewotse s'uwatse ik gawiyotse wotts keewwotsi bítsnooru b́ jiteyi jangonat k'irotse b́tuwi jango keewirwotsiye.</para>
  <para style="ip">B́ doo shishiyan s'uwoke k'nfiyotse fa'a git kaywotsitse, yoots mas'aafwotsitse ik ikwots mec'rotsna bo daatsefo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ doo shishi tuwoko 1:1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus Galiln fino dek' b́tuwok'o 1:14—9:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyerusalemitse b́fintsok'o 10:1-52</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyerusalemnat bgúúratse s'uwaatsi ik gawiyor 11:1—15:47</para>
  <para style="io1">Doonzo k'irotse b́ tutsok'o 16:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">K'irotse tuuts doonzo be'ewonat daromaand bí amtsok'o 16:9-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohans b́ nabtso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk'. 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Hań Ik'onaayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ik'o naayi: </char><char style="ft">Yoots mas'aaf ik ikwots Ik'o naayi etirwo dabrakno. </char></note> Iyesus Krstosko doo shishiyo b́ tuwokoni.<verse eid="MRK 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Nebiyiyo Isayasn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">«Hambe, nwerind foketwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">T woshtso nshinatse beshide woshitwee. <verse eid="MRK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Hanwere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‹Doonzosh weerindo k'aniwere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">B́fudonowere manutsiwere› etfere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Worwotse b́k'aaro eenshde'k't keewiru asho k'aaroniyee»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 1:3">ett guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Mansh gupfo Yohans «It morrosh orowe eto itdatsish naandrone err gupewere» ett worwotse kuhdek'et keewfere b́weyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Yhud datsonat Iyerusalem kitutse ay asho b́maantsa bowaafo, bo morro kish keewr Yordanosi eteets fokotse b́ kishatsna bogupefo.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Naash. 1:8</ref> </char>
    </note> Yohans tahonwere kambuli s'iron wozeka b́tesh. B́gebatso shaak'a bí edefo, b́maafonwere p'elonat dok'shi mas'ona. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Bí hank'owa bí'etfo «Túmr b́c'aami tipi joko bitsosh tborawo taayere ayidek' bogtso tshutsatse weeyirwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Taa iti aatson gupetwe, bímó itn S'ayn shayiron gupetwe.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́gupetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk'. 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:31-34">Yoh. 1:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Manoor Iyesus Galili eteets datsatse beyiru Naazreti eteef kituts waat́ Yordanos fokotse Yohans kishon b́gupeyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Yohans manoor, Iyesus aatsotse b́keshtsok'on daro gaad'at́ b́k'eshefere, S'ayin shayiro kurkund areyat bíyats b́ oot'́fere b́bek'i. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aze. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Dub. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mar. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk'. 3:22</ref> </char></note> Manoor «Taan gene'úshtso t shunts na'o neene» etiru k'ááro darotse b́weyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi fadetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk'. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Manóór Ik'i Shayiro Iyesusi worwots dek't bí'ami. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Manoknowere worwotse Shed'ano Iyesusi hab aawosh b́ fadfera b́teshi, dín s'ootswotsntoni b́ tesh, melkiwotsu bísh finernó botesh.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ daniyi fino Gelil datsatse dek' b́tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:14-17">Mat. 4:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk'. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Yohans detseyat tipimo b́ kindiyakon Iyesus, Ik'i mengsti jangosh doo shishiyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Doo shishyo: </char><char style="ft">Eto wongeliya etee. </char></note> nabfere Galil maants b́weyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat. 3:2</ref> </char></note> B́daniyoro, «Dúro s'uuwtsere, Ik'imengstu karnfere b́watsotse it naandrone erere, dooshishi nabetsono amanore!» bí etfo.<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus mus' detsf awdetswotsi b́s'eegtsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk'. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Maniye il Iyesus Gelil aatsk'ari ganoke beshefetst Simon nat bí eshu Indriyasn mus' detsfwotsi boteshtsotse bo mus' kambo aats k'aro maants boshap'fere boon b́ bek'i. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Iyesuswere «T jafrats woore itsh tdanisha, err mus' it detsirwok'o ashuwotsi it detsetwok'ó woshitwe» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Bowere manoor bo mus' detsi kambo k'azk'rat́ b́shuutso bo tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Maniyere múk'i beshat k'osh eshu gitwotsi b́bek'i. Bowere Zebdiyos nana'úwots Ya'ak'obnat Yohansna botesh. Bowere bo jelbotse bedek't bo mus' detsi kambo bok'anifera botesh. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Iyesus manoor boon b́s'eegi. Bowere bonih Zebdiyosnat bísh fin finirwotsn jelbatse k'azk'rat Iyesus jafrats boami.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kim shayiro bín s'eents asho b́kashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk'. 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Beshatnu K'frnahom kitots bobodi. Manoori waats sanbatots Iyesus Ayhdiwots Ik' k'oni mootse daniyo dek't b́twi. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat. 7:28-29</ref> </char></note> Iyesus, Muse nemo danifwots kok'o b́woterawo naashikook'o b́danifotse shishts jamwots b́daniyor ada bo adfo. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse beyiru ash iko gond shayiron s'eentso hank'o ett b́kúhi, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>«Nazrettso Iyesuso, nee nooke eeg kis'e ndetsi? Noon t'afiyosh waafi? Nee koni n wottsok'o taa daank'reree. Ik'oko S'ayino neene.»<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Iyesuswere gond shayirmansh «S'ik err, bí atsotse kee» ett b́fayi.<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Gond shayronwere ashman dikdek't b́s'ik'iyakon b́k'aaro eensh dek't kuhefetst bí atsotse b́ keshi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>«Eebi han naaroni? Hanwo handr daniyeya?» Gond shayirwotsi bí aloro bo bíshere bo aleyiri, ett adt bo atsatseyo aateyo dek' bo tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Muk'i b́teyawo, Iyesus shúútso Galil gúúratsi dats jamatse dane b́wtsi.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shodts ayuwotsi b́kashitsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk'. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Muk'ib́teyawo Iyesus ayhudi Ik' k'oni mootse kesht Yak'obnat Yohansnton, Simoonnat Indryasn moots b́kindi. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Maa manitsno Simon awu ats k'ees'its shodo shodat bk'efera btesh. Bshodmanowere manoor Iyesussh keewbok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Iyesuswere bmaand t'int́ bkisho detsdek't b́tuuzi. Bi atsi k'ees'onwere manoor binfakshb́k'ri. Tuwatnwere boon b ibiy.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Aawu bkindre datso bí iliyakon ashuwots shodtswotsnat fo'erawon detsets jamwotsi Iyesusok dek't boweyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Kititsi ash jamo maa úratse kakwe b́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Iyesus ay naari shoodon kic'iru ay ashuwotsi kashi b́k'ri. Fo'eraw aywotsno b́kishi. Fo'erawwotswere bí koni b́woto danfno botesh. Ernmó bokeewrawok'o boon b́baziyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Geliln doo shishiwo b́ nab́tsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Datso gatsosh bí etfere, Iyesus guuron tuut mootse kesht Ik' k'onosh ash aalok k'az bíami. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simoonnat bínton teshtswots bín geyo kesht boami. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Bín bodatstsok'ono «Ash jamonwo neenere b́geyiri» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Iyesuswere, «Taa twaa danyosh b́wottsotse doo shishiyo danyosh karnoke fa'a gal galóts amone!» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat. 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk'. 9:35</ref> </char>
    </note> Mann ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa mootse danifetsit fo'erawwotsnowere kishfere Galil dats jamatse b́gúúrefo b́tesh.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus eenshodets asho b́ s'ayintstsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk'. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Een shod detsts ash iko Iyesus maants waat b́ tufi shirots tuk'maldek't, «Ni eekiyal taan s'ayintso falfne» eton bín b́k'oni.<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Iyesuswere bísh maac'o k'ewat, b́kisho jargdek't shu'efetst, «Eekere s'ayine!» bí et. <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Ashmanwere manoor bí een shodotse s'ayinb́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Iyesus ashmansh kup'shdek't, ntooko korde'e ett faksh b́k'r. <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 4:1-32">Lew. 4:1-32</ref> </char></note> «Wotts keewan ik doonzshor nkeewrawok'o ni tooko korde'e, ernmó amr ntooko kahniyosh kitswe. Ashjamosh gaw b́wotish nkashtsotse Muse k'aluwere bí etts wosho t'intswe» ett bíazazi.<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Ernmó ashman manoke kesht keewman ashosh keewo dek't b́tuwi. Manatse tuutson Iyesus kit ikutsnor be'efetst kindo b́maawi. Ernmó kitoniye úratse ash aaloka b́befo. B́ wotefere ashuwots bo be beewoke b́ maants waa bowaafo.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ash duro Iyesus b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk'. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Múk' aawwotsiyere il Iyesus K'frnahom maants aanat b́weyi, manoke mootse b́beyirwok'o shisheb́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Moonwere bodo b́k'aye maa úronwere b́t'ebefetsosh ay asho kakwe b́wtsi. B́ doo shishiyi keewonowere boosh b́danifoni. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Manoor awd ashuwots ash dur iko kurdek't bíyok boweyi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Ash aytsatse tuutson duro Iyesusok de'et'ino maawt Iyesus kááwon maa tooko wogdek't duro bí ees'onton orshbok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Iyesuswere bo aman amano bek't durosh «T naayo n morro neesh orowa eteere» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Manoke bedek't teshts Muse nemo danifwotsitse ik ikewots bonibotse hank'o bo et. <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>«Ash han eegoshe hank'o c'asho Ik'ats b́ keewiri? Ik' ikoniye okoon morro orowe eto falitwo kone?»<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Muk'i b́teyawo Iyesus bonibotse bogawirwo hank'on dandek't boosh hank'o bí et, «Eegishe it nibotse man it gawiri? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Durosh ‹N morro neesh orowe eteere› etonat ‹Tuur ni es'o kur de'er amee!› etotse aaw ketefa? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Ernmó Ash na'o datsatsi morro orowe etosh alo b́detstsok'o it danetwok'owa!» ett durosh, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>«Tuwi, ni es'o kuurder ngalomand amee etirwe neesha» bí et. <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Duronú manoor tuut bí es'o kurdek't ash jami shinatse b́ keshi. Mansh ash jamo adt «Hank'o b́jamon be'e danaknona» ett Ik'o bo údi.<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Matiyosi eteetso Lewi b́ s'egtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk'. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Iyesuswere aani Galil aats k'aro ganok bíami, ash jamonúwere kakweyat b́maand boware boon b́danyi. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Man weeron b́beshefere t'ilish dek'eefoke beyirwo Ilfyos naay Lewi bek't, «T jafrats wowe» bí et. Bíwere tuut b́jafrats bí'ami.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Maniye il Iyesus Lewi mootse mishi maratse bedek'tni b́tesh. Ay asho b́ shuutso shoy dek' b́sha'iirwotse bínton t'ilish ko'iru aywotsnat morretswots, Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsnton mishi marats t'indek'tni botesh. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Ferisawino eteef jirwotsits wottswots Muse nemo danifwots, Iyesus t'ilish ko'ifwotsnat morretswotsnton b́maafere bek't «T'ilish ko'ifwotsntonat morretswotsnton eegoshe maat b́ úshiri?» ett b́ danifwotsi bo aati.<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Iyesuswere man shisht, «Shodtswotssha bako jeen wotssh atetso geyirakee, taawere tweyiye kááw finirwotssh b́woterawo morretswots bo naandosh oorowe eto bodaatsitwok'o s'eegoshe» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oomi jangosh aateetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk'. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Yohans danifwotsnat ferisawino eteefwots s'ooma bos'oomefo. Ik ik ashuwots Iyesus maants waat «Yohansnat ferisawino eteyrwots danifwotswo s'oomere bo s'oomefoni n danifwots s'oomo bok'az eegoshe?» bo et. <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Iyesuswere «Guuyo bonton b́befere guuy deentswots s'oomo boosh geyituwaa? Mank'oyaliye! guuyo bonton b́befere s'oomo boon geyiratse. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Ernmó guuyo booke b́ dek'et aawo weetwe. Manoor s'oomitúne. <verse eid="MRK 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>Tah nataats but'i handro shipfo aaliye, mank'o k'aleyalmó handr bút'onúwre taahdoro geets de'e gad'ni b́k'riti, b́gad'manwere baltsoniyere ikini b́gonditiye. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Mank'o weyiniyon dutsets biro bíts gas'ef arwi natoots handr weyniy biro gas'fo aaliye, mank'o k'aleyalmó weyiniyon dutsets birmań arwi natman t'up'ini b́k'riti. Woyniyon dutsets birmanwere kud'ni b́wtsiti. Arumanwere k'awntsalke b́wotiti. Mansha handr woyniyon dutsets birosh handir arwe b́geyiti» bí'et.<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sanbati aawi jangosh t'intsets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk'. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Iwi. 23:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Sanbati aawots Iyesus sndeyi tari taalon b́beshefera b́tesh. B́ danifwots amfets sendeyi motso k'ut'dek'o botwi. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Ferisawino eteyirwotswere «Hambe, n danifwots sanbati aawots fink'ayere eteesto eegishe bok'aliri?» ett bo'aati.<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-26 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bí'aani, «Dawit bínton sha'irwotsnton k'ak'at b́kic'or egb́k'altsok'oo nababeratsteya? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lew. 24:9</ref> </char></note> Abyatar kaheniyots naash b́tesho dúr, bí Ik'i moots kindt, kahniwotsi bako konwor b́marawok'o baziyetso, Ik'osh imets misho b́meyi bínton teshts ashuwotssh b́ími.»<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Aaninwere Iyesus boosh hank'o bí et, «Sanbati aawu ashosha bi azeyi bako asho sanbati aawosh azeratse. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Mank'owa Ash na'o sanbati aawush bdonziye.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Kish dúr Asho B́ Kashiytsok'oo.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk'. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Ayhdiwots Ik' k'oni moots Iyesus b́ kindi, manokno kish dúr ash iko fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Iyesusi s'aamiyo geyiru ashuwots, «Sanbati aawon ashaan b́kashiyo aab s'iilone!» ett kotdek'tni botesh. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Iyesuswere kish dur ashmansh, «Waa taalotse need'owe» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Maniyere il, «Sanbati aawon fin k'ayere eteetso sheeng finemo gond fine? Kash wooriyemó kash úd'e?» ett boon bíaati. Boomó s'ik et bowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Iyesuswere bonibo b́ duungtsotse shiyanat bín gúrdek't fa'úwotsi sheet't ashmansh, «Nkisho jargwe» bí eti. Bíwere b́ jargtsok'on b́ kisho kash b́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Manoor ferisawino eteyirwots kesht ak'alde'er Iyesusi bot'afitwok'o Herodsnton boshiyeyi.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashuwots aats k'ari ganoke Iyesusok kakwe b́wtstsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Iyesus b́ danirwotsnton Galil aats k'aromaants bí'ami. Gelilnat Yhuditse ay asho b́shuutso shoydek't b́twi. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>B́ k'aliru keew jamo boshishtsok'on ay ashuwots b́ shuutso botwi, manotswere Galiln, Yhudn Iyerusalemn, Edomiyasn, Yordanosiye bak'ets datsatse, mank'o T'irosnat Sidon kitotse waatswotswere fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9-10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mar. 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk'. 5:1-3</ref> </char></note> Asho bí aytsatse tuutson ashuwots datso bí ats t'ebir bín bokic'irawok'o jelbo bo k'anyitwok'o b́daniyrwotssh b́ keewi. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Ay ashuwotsi shodotse kashit b́ teshtsotse shodon kic'iru jamwots bokishon bín detso geeyat, bísh datso bot'ebifera botesh. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Kim shayirwots bín bobek'or b́ shinats gup' gup'at, «Nee Ik'o naay neene!» etfetstni bokuhefo.<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Bímó koni b́wottsok'o kish bokeewrawok'o kup'i dek' boon b́fay.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus tatse git woshetswotsi Galb́dek'tsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk'. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Iyesus guri abaats b́keshtsok'on b́geyirwotsi b́maants b́ s'eegi, boowere b́maants bo t'iini. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Bínton bobeyish, bo nabishowere, boon woshosho tatse gitwotsi galb́dek't «Woshetswotsi» ett bo shúútso b́kshi. <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>Fo'erawwotsi bo kishitwok'owero alo boosh b́ imi.<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Galb́dek'ts tatse gitwotswere hanotsi, «P'et'rosi» ett b́ s'eegtso Sim'oni.<verse eid="MRK 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>«Bo'anergesi» wee guumi na'uwotsi ett bo shúúts b́kishtswots Zebdiyos nanaúwots Yak'obnat Yohansna, <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Indriyasi, Flip'osi, Bertelmiyosi, Matiyosi, Tomasi, Ilfyos naay Yak'obi, Tadiwosi, wed'eyirwoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wed'eyiruwo: </char><char style="ft">Wed'etsi eta, plotik ikotsi ashe etirwotsu fa'ano. </char></note> Sim'onnat, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Iyesusi beshidek' imtso Kiriyot kittsi asho Yihudi.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat Beel zebuln.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat. 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk'. 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Maniyere il Iyesus moots b́kindi. Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsn mish moonor bomawfetsosh aani ankat ashuwots kakwe bowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>«Iyesus geewtsere» eteere boshishtsotse b́ jagwots bín detsosh b́maand boweyi.<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Iyerusalemn oot' waats Muse nemo danifwots, «Bí'atsnee B'elzebuliye fa'oni, Fo'erawotsi b́kishiriye Fo'erawi naash wottso Beelzebulne!» ett bo keewi.<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere boon b́maand s'eegdek't́ jewrdek't hank'o boosh bí et, «Shed'ano aawk'o k'alderniya Shed'ano kisho b́ faliti? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Ik mengsto kayewtsarr bí atsatseyo b́ gawetka wotiyal mengst man kup'ar need'o falratse. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Mank'o Ik meyitsi asho bí atsatsewo b́k'aleyal kup'ar need'o falratse. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Mansha Shed'ano bí atsatsewo b́ k'aletka wotiyal t'afa b́t'afiti bako beyo falratse.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>«Mank'o ash kúp' iko moots kindr b́detstso biik'oosh shin kúp'man b́ tifawo falitwo aaliye.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>«Ariko it́sh etirwe ashuwots bofiniru morronat bokeewiru c'ash jamosh boosh orowe eteetwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk'. 12:10</ref> </char></note> Ernmó S'ayn shayir c'ashetu jamo dúre dúrosh bo morro bo aatsa b́ wotiti bako b́ jamon boosh orowe eteeratse.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Iyesus han b́ keewwere, «Kim shayire bíyatse fa'oni,» bo ettsosha b́tesh.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus indnat bí eshwotsn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk'. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Iyesus indnat bí eshwotsn bíyok boweyi. Uratsno need'dek't bíyok asho woshat bo s'eegi. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Bín gúúrdek't́ beyiru ashuwots, «Hamb! nindnat n eshwots úratse need' dek't neene bogeyiri» ett bokeewi.<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Bí were «Tind kone? Tí eshwots konotsne?» ett bí aani. <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Bín gúrdek't́ beyiru ash aywots maantsan s'iilfetst, «Eshe! tindnat ti eshwots hanotsiye! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Ik' etts jamo k'alitwo ti'eshu, tmishu, tindu bíne.» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Shook shookirwon ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk'. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Iyesus aani aats k'ari ganoke daniyo dek't b́tuwi. Ayidek't ayts ash asho b́ maants waat bokakwetsotse bí aats k'aratse fa'a jelbuts kindt be b́dek'i, ash jamonúwere aatsi k'ari gúúratsa b́tesh. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Ay keewwotsnowere jewron boosh b́dany. B́daniyoro boosh hank'owa bí'et. <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>«K'ewere! goshtso b́shooko shookosh dek' b́keshi. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>B́shookfere maay shook ik iko weeri gúrats fed' b́wtsi. Kafwotswere waat mec'dek't maa bok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Shook k'osho shawi ayo bíaalok dats t'orats fed' b́ wtsi. B́ datso shawi ayo b́t'ut'tsotse manoor bos' b́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>B́ wotiyalor aawo bí'ats b́keshtsok'on shoolb́wtsi. Dashan ay geenzts s'ap'o b́ deshawotse shuuk' b́wts. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>K'osh shookonúwere angits t'ugi taalots fed'b́wtsi. Angitsonu bí eentsok'on guk'b́dek'tsosh shuwalo b́ oori. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Shook k'osho dats sheengats fed'at bos'b́wtsi. B́ bos'onwere eent shuwo b́imi, k'atso shasho, k'atso keez úbo, k'atsonúwere balo b́shwi.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Manats dabt́ Iyesus, «Shishts waaz detstso k'ewde'e!» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jewron b́keewir eegosh b́wottsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk'. 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Iyesus bí'aali b́ wotor b́ shuuts sha'iru ashuwotsnat tatse git b́ danifwotsnsh jewron b́keewts keewi biitso boaati. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Bíwere boosh hank'owa bí et, «Itsho Ik'i mengisti jango ááshts keewo it danetwok'o imere. Úre beyirwotsshmó boosh jamo jewrone keeweti. <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref> </char></note> Man b́wotitwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‹Bo Ik'omaants aanarr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Bomorro boosh orowa eterawok'owe,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">S'iilo s'ilfetsr bo be'awok'o</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Shísho shífetsr bot'iwintsrawok'owa,» eteetsok'one.<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shook shookirwo ariyetsman b́ biitso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat. 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk'. 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Iyesuswere hank'owa boosh bí et, «Itshowere jewron keewetsan galiyalkeya? Bére, k'osh, jewron keewets jamwotsi ak'alde'erniya t'iwintso itfaliti? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Shookirwo Ik'i aap'oni b́ shookri. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Ik' aap'tso shookewor, shooko shookere werindats fed'tsman b́kitsir Ik'i aap'tso bok'ebor manóór shed'ano wáát bonibitse shooketsman mec'dek' b́wtsts aashwtsi b́ kitsir. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Mank'o dats t'orats shooketsman b́kitsir, Ik'i aap'o boshishor manóór gene'on dek'ts ashuwotsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Ernmó manórisha bako bonibotse s'ap' de'atse. Muk'i boteshiyakon Ik'i aap'atse tuutson gishewo wee gond bek'o boats b́bodal manoor dihiniye bowtsiti. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Angitsi taalots shooketsonmó b́kitsir Ik'i aap'tso k'ebiru ashuwotsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>Wotowa eree datsanatsi asaabiyo, gizi shunonat k'osh wotera tewnon bonibots kindr Ik'i aap'o gu'u b́dek'etwotse shuwalo b́ ooriti. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Dats sheengats shooketsonmó, Ik'i aap'tso shisht t'iwintsdek't k'aaúdek'tswotsi b́kitsir. Man naaro k'atso shasho, k'atso keez úbo, ik ikonúwere bal shuwa b́shuwit.<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">C'eesho b́ c'eesheyir shááno b́ imetwok'o b́wottsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk'. 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>«Asho c'eesho c'eeshde'e gongrots gedfamó wee oosho bí ats gúp'shfá? B́ gedfo b́ shááno b́be'etwok'o grgjiyatsosha? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk'. 12:2</ref> </char></note> Mank'o áátsetso b́ be'erawo, áshtso danerawon ooreratse. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Eshe shishts waaz detstso k'ewde'e!»<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Aani Iyesus boosh hank'owa bí et, «It k'ebiru keewosh it tooko korde'ere, it tatsts tatsik'ac'on itsho tatsetwe, ikinwere itish ayide'erni dabeti. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk'. 19:26</ref> </char></note> Detstsosh dabde'e imetwe, deshawatsnmó dab́ b́ detstsonor bí'atse k'aa'úniye dek'eti.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eeniru shookon ariyetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Manats dabt, Iyesus hank'owa bí et, «Ik'i mengistú datsats shook shokirw ashoniye bi ari. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Ashman t'ú tokritwe, aawo tuwitwe, aawk'o b́wottsok'o b́danawo shooko boc'b́wtsiti, een b́wtsiti. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Datsunu b́tookon shino b́bos'o, ilo b gimbo kitsitwa, manyako b jáábatse shuwo daatsetwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Iyu. 3:13</ref> </char></note> Mayonúwere borbwtsor mááy kakwo b́bodtsotse asho manoor maac'iro k'anib́k'riti.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dogni aawn ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-34">Mat. 13:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk'. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Iyesus hank'owa bí et, «Ik'i mengstu kontoniya no nutsiti? Himo egoneneya aride'e no kitsiti biina? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Snafic'i aawniye bi ari, bi shookewor datsatse fa'a shook jamotse múk'efuniye. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Bi shookeyakonmó eenr bos' jamwotsiyere bbogeti, darotsi kafwots bshirotse kúto aade beyo bofalfetsosh een een jabwotsi kish dek'etúwane.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Iyesuswere ashuwots t'iwintsdek'o bofalitwok'on, hanank'ón b́ keewo ay jewron boosh b́keewfoni. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Bí b́ jewrerawo boon daniraka b́tesh, bo'aali bowootormo b́ danifwotssh jamkeewo iza b́ izfo.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kúp' jongon giwts aatso s'ik bí aayitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk'. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Manots kooc' Iyesus b́ danifwotssh, «Aats k'araniye bak'ets kimone» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Ash asho k'azk'rat biyats keshdek't b́beyir jelbúts Iyesusi dek't boami. Jelb k'oshwotswere towat fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Eegurahi kúp'o aatsatse tuut jelbuts aatso b s'eenfetso jongon giwts aatso jelbu togo dek't b́ tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Mank'o b́wotor Iyesus, jelbu shuutso maantsi kayotse k'oyo k'oy dek't b́k'efera b́tesh. B́ danifwots bín tuzdek't «Danyifono! noo nó t'affe nee no kis'o deshatsiya?» bo eti. <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Bíwere tokrotse tuut jongman bíhadi, aats k'armanshowere «S'ik eree» bí eti. Jongonu k'az b́k'ri, ay dek' s'ik etb́wtsi.<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Iyesuswere, «Hank'o itshatir eegoshe? Aak'owe imnetiyo it t'ut'i?» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Bowere ay shatwtsat, bo atsatsewo «Jongonat aats k'aron bísh bo aleyirwan kone bíwo?» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kim shayiron s'eents asho b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk'. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Gelil aatsk'aro jelebon kímt Gergesenon datsomand am bobodi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Iyesus jelbwatse b́ oot'tsok'on kim shayiron detsets ash iko doowi beewoke kesht manóór gonke b́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Ashman doowi ganoka b́befo, konúwor habilyon tifr bín ned'iyosh falraka. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Ayoto muk'onat habiliyona bín tipefo, ernmó habiliyono k'ut'a b́k'ut'fo, muk'ono tishdeni b́juwefo mansh konwor bín deshde'er ned'iyosh falfo aali b́tesh. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Úni aawonowere t'uwe aawon b́ned'irawo doowi bewokonat guri aab abaatse anaanar b́kuhefoni, bí atsonowere shútson k'ut'de'erni b́gaawifo.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Bíwere Iyesusi wokoon b́ bek'tsok'on b́maand wos't b́gubron tuk'maldek't bísh b́sagadi. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>K'aari eenon k'et'efetst́, «Nee Ik' eeno naay Iyesuso! Nee tiyoke eeg kis'e ndetsi? Ik'i shútson neen k'onre, oona neesha! taan ono bek'shk'aye!» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Man bíettsonwere, «Nee gond shayirono ashaanitse kee!» ett azazat b́teshtsosha.<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Iyesuswere «N shúútso kone?» ett bíaati, bíwere «Aywotsi nowottsotse t shútso kes'i jirwotsi.» ett bí aani. <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Datsmanatsnowere boon b́ giisherawok'o ayidek't b́k'oni.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Manokno guritsi s'eeno guri ganoke jinirwots fa'ano botesh.<verse eid="MRK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Mansh «Oona neesha! amr guritswotsits nokindish noon bazik'aye,» ett bok'oni. <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Iyesuswere boosh bíeekere, gond shayirwots ashmanitse kesht guritswotsits bokindi, guritsi s'eenotse git kumok'o wotts guritswots gohatse tengsheyat oot't aatsi k'arots lim bowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Gurits jinirwots giifat k'az boami, kitonat gat'ariyon keewman keewbok'ri, ash ashonwere wotts keewman bek'osh bo maa mootse bokeshi. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Iyesusmaants bowatsok'on, kim shayiron detseyat teshts ashman bí'atso dandek't, b́ taho tah dek't, b́ befere bek't tek'bowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Man shin bek'ts ashuwotswere kim shayirman bítse b́ s'eents ashonat guritswotsitse wotts jamo waatswtssh bokeewi.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Manóór datsmanatsi ashuwots Iyesus bodatsatse keer k'ay bíametwok'o bo k'oni.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Iyesus jelbúts kindoke b́befere fo'erawo bín s'eent teshts ashman, «Oona neesha! n shuutso amna» ett bín b́k'oni.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Iyesusmó bísh eekeratse, ernmó, «N gal amr doonzo aawk'o een keewo neesh b́fintsok'owonat aak'o k'aldek't neesh maac'o b́k'ewtsok'o n maa ash ashosh keewwe,» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Ashmanwere Iyesus bísh b́k'alts jamo «Tats kitwotsi» eteets datsatse keewfere b́ tuwi, shishts jamwotswere bo adi.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iya'íros ni'nat Iyesus tahats bodts máátsu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk'. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Iyesus jelbon aats k'aroniye bak'ets aani kímt bí aaniyakon ay asho bíyok kakwe b́wtsi, manormó bí aats k'ari gúúratsa b́ tesh. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Manoknó ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa naashwotsitse iko fa'e b́tesh. Iya'irosi eteets asho Iyesusi b́bek'tsok'on b́ tufishirots diht <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>«T na'a múk'efu k'iroshe bi'etiri, woorr kashon b́beyishe oona neesha! waar n kisho biyats gere!» ett kúp'idek't b́ k'oni.<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Iyesuswere bínton towat bí ami, ay ashuwotswere b́ jafrats sha'at bísh datso bot'ebifere botesh.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Tatse git natosh s'atso kud'at ned'ok'azt bí'ere gond bek'iru mááts iku fa'a btesh. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>At dants aaywotsok sha'a mawat gondo bek'aat b detsts giz jamo ishbazateni b tesh. Ernmó iki gondefera bí'ami bako b́ jamon shamp'eratsa. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Bi were Iyesus jango shishat bteshtsotse gifniyeyiru ash dagotse b́ jiik'weeron waat b́ taho b t'awi. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Hano b k'al, «Dab b́ tahats t bodal kashitwe,» etaat amanat b teshtsotsna.<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>S'ats kud'manu manór need' b́wtsi, b shodotsno b́ kashtsok'o bi atsotse bish b́shiyeyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Iyesuswere manoor ango bí'atse b́keshtsok'o danb́k'ri, ashuwots maants wongr ett aanat, «Kone t taho t'awitsoni?» ett bí aati.<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>B́ danifwotswere, «Ash asho bí atsatsewo gifniyefetst n shuutso b́ sha'efere bek'fetsatniya ‹Kone ti ats bodi?› ni etiri?» bo et.<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Bíwere man k'altso koni b́ woto bek'osh wongr et aanat b́ s'iili. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Máátsmanmo bi ats wottso b dantsotse shatoon k'ewefetsat b́ shinats dihat ari keewjamo bísh b keewi.<verse eid="MRK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Bíwere «T ni'e n imnetiyo neen kashire, jeenon amee, n gond bek'otsnowere kashowe,» bish b́ eti.<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Iyesus man keewoke b́befere, ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa jishirwo gále waats ashuwots ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa jishf́mansh, «N naa'u k'irwtseraniyere! eshe haniyak eegoshe danifo n shambiriri?» bo eti. <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Iyesusmó man shisht ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa jishfmansh, «Amanowe bako shatk'aye!» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Iyesus P'et'rosnat Yak'obn, ando Yak'ob eshu Yohansiye okoon konúwor b́shutsoshoyde b́ warawok'o b́baziyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa jishfman mook bobodtsok'on, Iyesus ashuwots waac'refetst bo eepfere, bo kuheferowe b́ bek'i. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Gítsomand kindtnu, «Wac'r jamannat eepan, eegoshe? Na'ú tokra b tokri bako k'irratsane,» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Ashuwotsmo bí atsa bomiis', Iyesusmó bo jametsi mootse kishbazt, na'ú nihnat indun, b́ shuuts shairwotsi dek't na'ú beyiru maa kayots b́ kindi. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Na'ú kisho dets dek't, «T'alita kumi!» bish bí et. Man etonwere «Nee na'a múk'na'une neesh tuuwe etfe,» eta.<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Biwere tatse git nati na'a b wottsotse manóór hake bak sha'o dek' btuwi, hank'o b́ wotoro ashuwots ayidek' bo adi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Iyesusmó wotts keewan konúwor b́danawok'owa koneshor keew k'ayere ett, «B meetwo bish imere!» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Naazretn b́gac'eetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk'. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Iyesus manoke kesht b́datsomand b́ weyi, b́ danifwotswere b́shuutso shoydek't boweyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Sanbati aawon ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse daniyo dek' b́twi, ash ayonwere manoke daatseyat bín bok'ebfera botesh, boowere «Ashaan keew jaman eewkneya b́daatsi? Eegi naari dane bísh imetsani? Adits keewanotsi aak'o k'aldek'tnya b́finiri?» ett bo adi. <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Aaninwere dabt «Han Mariyam naay mit gashfoniyoshna? Yak'obsho, Yosasho, Yihudsho, Simonsho bo eshwi woshna? B́mishots hanoke nontoniyosha bofa'oni?» ett gac'at bín de'aniyere bo oori.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoh. 4:44</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesusmó, «Nebiyiyo k'osh dats ashoknee mango b́ datsiti, ernmó b́ took datsatse, b́ jagi datsatsnat b́ meyitsi ashuwots dagotsnmo gac'etwe,» ett boosh bíaany.<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Manokno k'ats shodetswotsats b́ kisho gedt kashiyoniye okoon adits finwotsi k'alo falratse. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Ash asho amaneraniyere bo'ortsatse tuutso ayi dek't bí'adi, maniyakon Iyesus gál gálots ananatni b́ danifo.<verse eid="MRK 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tatse git b́ wosheetsots daniyish bowoshewok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk'. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Tatse gitwotsi bíyok s'eegdek't git gito woshdek't b́woshi, kim shayirwotsatse alo boosh bí imi, <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8-11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk'. 10:4-11</ref> </char></note> Boamor weerindatse gumboniye okoon mish wotowa, k'arc'itono, gizono bo edots desh bode'aawok'o boon bí azazi. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Boshowere hank'o bí eti, «It tufots c'aamo gerde'ere bako git kito dab kark'ayere, <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Aawoknoor ash maa ikots it kindor, datsman itfakshfetsosh itkindts maamanitsne it tesheti. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Wosh. 13:51</ref> </char></note> Ashuwots iti ibiyo k'ayr it keewo k'ebono bok'azts jamoke it tufatsi k'undo tebk'rar keer k'ayamere, manwere bo ats gawe b́ wotitiye.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Woshetswotswere manoke kesht, ash jamo naandrone bí'etetwok'o bodany. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak'. 5:14</ref> </char></note> Fo'eraw aywotsnowere bokishi, ay ashuwotsatso zeyito futt bokashiyi.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohansi úd'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk'. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Iyesus shútso eent jamoke daneb́wtstsotse, nugúso Herodiswor b́ jangman shishb́k'ri. Ik ik ashuwots, «Gupfo Yohans k'irotse tuure, manshe adits keew jamanotsi k'aliruwo bíne» boetfere botesh.<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-15</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar. 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk'. 9:19</ref> </char>
    </note> K'oshwotswere, «Bíwo Eliyasiye» bo etfera botesh, oortswotswere «Yotsi nebiywotsitsi ikok'oyiye» bo etiri.<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Herodismó jam man shisht, «Han b́biimb tk'ut'itso Yohansiye, hambe! bík'irotse k'az tuure,» bí et. <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Herodis bí'eshu Filip'os máátsu Herodyadi b́dek'tsosh, Yohansi biyatse tuutson detsidek't típmoo gedt́ bín tipitni b́ b́tesh. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17-18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 3:9-20">3:9-20</ref> </char></note> Yohans b́tipewere, Herodisish «Ni eshu máátsu dek'o nemotse aaliye!» err b́ keewfosha b́tesh.<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Herodiyadu mansh iirat Yohansi úd'iyosha b́geefo b́teshi, ernmó falratsa. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Herodiswere maniye shin Yohans kááwonat S'ayn b́woto b́ dantsotse bín sharfetsni b́ kotiifo. Herodis Yohans keewo b́ shishtsi taawo kic'a b́ kic'efo, b́woteferor geneeúwona bín b́ k'eebfo. <verse eid="MRK 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Herodis b́ shuweyi aawo mangiyosh naash naashwotssh, kes' jishirwotssh, Gelilitse fa'a daneets ik ikwotssh moonat ushon k'ani b́k'ri. Mannowere Herodiyad sheeng weero datsbdek'i. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Manno Herodiyad ni'i móónat ushi moots kindat k'afefetsat Herodisnat bínton teshts ibwotsi b gene'ushi, naashonwere na'úsh, «N geets keewo b́wottso b́wotiyalor taan aatwe neesh imetwe» bí et. <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>«Dab t mengsti badonor b́wotiyal, ni'aatts jamo neesh imetwe!» ett bish b́ taari.<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Biwere bi'indok amaat, «Eego aatuta?» bieti, bi'indwere « ‹Gupfo Yohans tooko taash imewe› err aatwe» bi et.<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Na'únwere manoor kááron naashomand aanat, «Gupfo Yohans tooko saniyots gerde and taash imeyish geefe,» etaat bi'ati.<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Nugúsonwere keewmaanatse tuutso ayidek't shiyanbwtsi, wotowa bako s'eegets ashuwots shinatse b́ taartsotse bi attsman bish baziyo geeratse. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Mansh nuguso manoor kotiru kes' kes'fwotsitse, iko Yohans tooko k'ut'de b́ weetwok'o b́ wosh, kes'fonwere tipi maa manits amt Yohans tooko b́ k'ut'i, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>K'ut'ets tokmano sahaniyots ged dek'wat na'úsh bí imi, na'únwere b indsh imbk'eri. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Yohans danifwotswere man bo shishtsok'on waat b́ duuno dek't bo duuki.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus úts kum shuwotsi b́maanzitsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk'. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Wosheetsots boon woshetsoke aani waat Iyesus shinatse kakwe bowtsi, bo danitsonat bo k'alts jamo bísh bokeewi. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Bíwere «Itiye itaal ash aaloke ikmaants amr muk'i kashde'ere,» bí eti, man bí'etwere b́maand weyirwonat amiruwon bo aytsotse misho dab bo metwoko bo t'ut'tsotsne. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Mansh boaali wotosh jelbots kind dek't ash aalok k'az boami.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Bo amfere ay ashuwots boon bek't danbok'r, kit kitotse kesht tufoon wos'fere boshino beshat book kakwebowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Iyesus jelbutse b́ oot'or ay ashuwotsi b́ bek'i. Jints deshaw mereerwotskok'o bowottsotse boosh maac'o k'ewbwtsi, ay keewonowere boosh daniyo dek' b́ tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Datso ilefere bí amtsotse b́ danifwotsi b́ maants t'int bísh hank'o bo et, «Hanokhaniye worwe, datsonwe ilere, <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Bo metwonu bí altsotse gúranatse fa'a gat'ariwotsnat gal galotse amr misho keew bodek'etwok'o hanotsi deenk'rowe.»<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Iyesusmó, «Bo bometwo boosh it imere» ett boosh bíaani. Bowere «Beree am bo meet misho git bal dinariyon <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ik dinarriyo: </char><char style="ft">Ik aawo ash iko b́ finor bísh dashef ik aaw k'awntsa. </char></note>kewde boosh imonowa?» boet. <verse eid="MRK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Bíwere, «Ambts mishe it detsi? Aab amr s'iilere,» bí eti, s'iiltnwere «Úts mishonat git mus'on fa'ee,» boeti.<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Iyesuswere ash ashosh kakuwe kakuwede'er, atts sismanats bo bezitwok'o b́ danifwotssh bí azazi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Mansh ashuwots ikok balo ikoko balk'atso kakuwe kakuweyat be bodek'i <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Iyesuswere úts mishmannat git mus' manotsi k'aaú dek't daro maants kááw dek't s'iilt b́ deeri, mish mano tiitsdek't ashuwotssh bo kayitwok'o b́ danifwotssh bí ími, mank'o mus' gitwotsno jamwotssh b́ kayi. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Jamwots máát bowori <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>B́ danifwotswere meere oorts mishi tiish tisho tatse git mari s'eeno bo kaakwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Mishman maats nungshwots taawó úts kumok'oy b́ tesh.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aatsi k'ari abaatse shaawefere bí'amtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Iyesus manór ashuwotssh ameree etfetst b́ danifwots jelbots wotde'e bak'ets Bete Sayd maants kimr b́shino bok'ut'itwok'o boon bíazazi. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Maniyere hakon bo atse k'aleyat Ik'o k'onosh guromants b́ keshi. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Datsonwere b́ ilor jelbu aats k'ari taalotsa b tesh, bímo bíyal datsatsa b́ tesh. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>B́ danifwots bo shinatse jongiru jongatse tuutson jelbu joko maawt bo kic'efere bek'b́k'ri, t'úwotse jed'iy sa'atonat tatse git sa'ati dagotse aats k'aratse shaawefere bo maants b́ weyi, boyere beshar amosha b́ tesh. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Ernmó bí aats k'ari abaatse shaawefere bí'amfere meyo boosh bíartsosh bo kuhi. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Jamwots bín bo bek'tsok'on tekbowtsi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Bímó manoor, «Kup'ore shenúwotso! taane! shatk'ayere!» bíet, <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Jelbots kindt, bonton beb́dok'tsok'on jongo ned'b́wtsi, b́ danifwotsu ay dek't bo adí. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Bo nibo dungwtsat, mishatse wotts adits keewman bo t'iwintsrawo ooratni bako, keewan boon adirawnk'e b́ tesh.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Gensaret'n shodtswotsi b́kashyok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat. 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Aats k'aro bo kimtsok'on, Genseret'its am bo bodi, jelbu datsats t'intsdek't tipbok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Jelbu'abatse bo ot'tsok'ón manóór ashuwots Iyesusi danbok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Bowere datsman gúratse hake bako wos'fetst Iyesus b́beyiru kááw jamok shodetswotsi es'ats kurdek't woo bo tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Bí amts jamoke gal galotse, kitotse, gat'ariyotsno shodtswotsi jebats kisht b́ shinats bo t'intsfera boteshi, b́ shemi jilo dab t'awiyosh bín bok'onfo, bíats bodts jamwotswere kasha bokashefo.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Nih nihwots niwi jango.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat. 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Ferisawino eteetswotsnat Iyerusalemn waats Muse nemo danif ik ikwots Iyesusmaants waat bín gúúrdek't kakwebowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Iyesus b́ danifwotsitse niwon bo s'aynawo man etonwere kisho bo masherawon misho bomaafere bobek'i.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Ferisawino eteetswotsnat ayhudi eenashwotsn bo niwo koton sheengsh bo kisho bo masherawo marakno bo tesh. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Mank'o gawiyon bo aanoro bo masherawo marakno, wanc'ono, korono, k'áázon dozets kac'onat es'on mashok'o wotts ayo bo nemo bokotfo.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Hank'o b́wottsotse ferisawino eteetswotsnat Muse nemo danirwots, «N danifwots eenash eenashwots nemo tiitst, eegishe kisho bomasherawo misho bomeyiri?» ett Iyesusi bo aati.<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Bímó hank'o ett boosh bíaani, «It git alberetswotso! Isayas it jangosh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‹Ash ashaaniye bo noon mec'rone taan bomangiri bako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Bo nibo tiyatse woke!<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Ash niwo Ik'i nemok'o woshdek't danifetst k'awntsalosh taan bomangiyiri!› ett b́ keewts bek'o aree.<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>«Mansh it Ik'i alo k'azat ash nema it kotiri.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus hank'owa boosh bí et, «It nemo kotosha etaat Ik'i nemo it tiitsiri, <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Muse, ‹N nihnat nindn mangiwe, aaninu b́ nihsh wee b́ indsh gondo keewit asho úd'ewe,› etre. <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Itmó hank'owa it etfoni, ‹Ash iko b́ nihnat bíndsh k'alo bín geyits keew jamoniye K'urbani wotere› man etonwere ‹Ik'osh imk'rekee› boosh bí'etal, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>B́ indnat b́ nihi tep'o k'azo falfe etetute. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Hank'onowere it took nemo k'otosha etaat Ik' aap'tso it gaakiri. Mank'onowere han artso ay keewe it k'aliri.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash kiimshf keewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat. 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Ash ashonowere aani b́ maants s'eegdek't, boosh hank'o bí eti, «It únets t'iwintsde taan k'ewere, <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Ash kimshfoniye, ash gitsotse keshetwoniye bako, uratse ash gitsomaants kindirwoniye asho kimshrake! <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Eshe k'ebet waaz detstso k'ewe!»<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Iyesus ash asho k'azk'rat moots b́ kindtsok'on b́ danifwots aridek' b́ keewtsman biitso bín bo aati. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Bíwere hank'o ett boosh bíaani, «Itwere han t'iwintsratsteya? Uratse ash atsi gitsomaants kindit keewo ash kimsho b́falawok'o itsh galeratsa? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Maac' weeron beshar uromaantsa b́ kesheti bako nibomand amatse». Hannowere Iyesus meetu jamo s'ayin b́wottsok'o b́ daniyi.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Manats dabt hank'owa bíet, «Ash kimishfwots ashnibotse keshf keewwotsi. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Bowere, gond tewno, wido, úmp'o, ash úd'o, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>gobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Goba: </char><char style="ft">Ash maatsok amtsoni. </char></note>, jaalo, weeri gondo, ash dirsho, shiraats jintsi woto, okooro, onoo, b́ tooko dambaan danbaan detso, kis' deshawo wotonat hanotsiye. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Gond keew jaman ash nibotsne b́ keshfoniye, ashono b́ kimshfoni.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mááts Iku imnetiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat. 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Iyesus manoke tuut T'iros kitu ganoke fa'a galots bíami, maa ikots kindit manoke b́ beyirwok'o konwor b́ danawok'o b́ geyi, wotowa bako ááshosh falratse. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>B na'ú kim shayiron detsets mááts iku Iyesus jango shishat manóór waat b́ tufi shishirots b dihi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Máátsunwe Sirofinik'e dats ashu wotat Griki noon keewf ashi b tesh, biwere bna'ú atsotse fo'erawo b́kishish Iyesusi b́k'oni, <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Iyesusmó, «Nana'i misho de'er kanwotssh imo woteratse aab shin nana'uwots worune,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Bi were «Aree tdoonzo, b́ woteferor kanwotswor mari shirotse wotde nana'o b́ mafere fed'ts mishi fed'o mafnale,» etaat biaani.<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Mansh Iyesus, «N keewanatse tuutson fo'erawo n na'ú aatsótse keshre, éshe n gál amee!» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Biwere b galomaants bi aanór b na'ú fo'erawo fakshb́k'erere es' abaatse jeenon b k'eefere datsbdek'i.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus gidik'onat duts asho b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Iyesus T'iros datsatse kesht k'az bíami, Sidon weeron amt Tats kita eteef datson Galil aats k'aromaants b́ weyi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Manoke gidik' wotat, aani dutso b́ maants dek't boweyi, b́ kishono bí ats b́ gedetwok'o bok'oni. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Iyesuswere ashman ashotse k'aldek't bí aali dek' amt b́ jaabo ash man waazots gedt, s'udono tuf ett asho alberono b́ shuu'í, <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Daromaand kááw dek't s'iilt ah ett kasho wosht ashmansh «Eeftah!» bí et. B́ biitsonwere «K'eshewe!» etee.<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Manóró b́ waazo k'eshe b́wutsi, bíalberonwere bish b́ wutsi, ik kic'alono s'ayintsdek't keewo dek' b́ tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Iyesus keewan konshor bokeewrawok'o ashuwotsi bí azazi, wotowa bako bokeewrawok'o bíazaztsoniye bogshdek't ay dek'tni bokewfo bo teshi. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Shishts jamwotswere ay dek't adt, «Jam keewo sheengonee b́fiini! gidik'wotsu boshishetwok'o, dutswotswere bo keewitwok'owe b́ k'aliri!» bo et.<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus awd kum ashuwotsi b́maanzitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat. 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Manoori aawwotsitse aani ay ashuwots kakwe bowtsi, bometwono deshatsno bo tesh, mann Iyesus b́ danifwotsi s'eegdek't boosh hank'o bí eti, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>«Ashaanots hamb, taanton keez aawo teshrnee, bometwo eegor bo deshawotse boosh t maac'o k'ewere, <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Hank'on bo k'ak'tsok'on bo gálomants ameree err t fakshiyal weerindatse maawniye bowtsiti, dab boyitse ik ikwots wokooke waaknee.»<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>B́ danifwotswere, «Béré worwotse jam ashaanotssh bodet misho kone daatso faliti?» ett bísh bo aani. <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Iyesuswere, «Ambts misho detsfte?» ett boon bíaati, boowere, «Shawat misho detsfone» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Ashuwots datsats beewne bíeti, shawat mishono dets dek't Ik'osh mango b́ ími, tiitsdek't ash ashosh bo imetwok'o b́ danifwotssh b́ ími, boowere ash ashosh bo t'intsi. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Ay woterawo mus' nana'úwotsno detsfno botesh, mus' manots jangosho Ik'o b́údiyakon ash ashosh bo t'intsitwok'o b́ danifwotssh b́ keewi. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Jam ashuwots máát bowori, méére oorts mishi tiish tishono kakut shawat een een maron s'eeno bo k'aaúwi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Maats ashuwotsu awd kumok'o wotituno botesh, Iyesus bono ameree ett faksh b́ k'ri. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Maniyere il b́ danifwotsnton jelbats wotdek't Dalmanut awrajo maants k'azbíami.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adits keewo bek'osh aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat. 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk'. 11:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Ferisawino eteyirwotsitse Iyesus maants waat bínton moosho dek' botwi, bín fadosh gawt darotse adits keew iko boosh b́kitsitwok'o bín bo'aati. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk'. 11:29</ref> </char></note> Iyesus ah ett kashowosht, «Dúranatsi s'oot'o adits keewo bísh k'aleyish eegosh geefa? Aroniye itsh t keewiri, dúranatsi na'osh b́ jamon adits keewo kitseratse!» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Boon k'az k'rat aani jelbats wotdek't bak'etsomand k'az b́ kimi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ferisawino eteefwotsnat Herodis boot' shasho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat. 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>B́ danifwots misho bo battsatse tuutson jelbotse ik mishuniye okoon eegor deshatsno bo tesh. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk'. 12:1</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere «Ferisawino eteefwotsnat Herodis boot' shashatse it atso korde'ere,» ett bí azazi.<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Bowere «Han bí etir, daneraka misho no t'ut'tsosha b́wotiti» ett boatsatseyewo bokeewi.<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Iyesusewere bo gawirwo dandek't hank'o boosh bí eti. «Misho no t'út'tsosha etaat eegoshe it gawiri? Andoor eegor t'iwintso falawwotsnat danawots itneya? It nibo andoor b́ dungtsok'oneya b́fa'oni? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Erm. 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Hzk'. 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar. 4:12</ref> </char></note> Ááwo detsfetsat be'aatsteya? Waazono detsfetsat shiyatsteya? Aak'oneya gaweyo itsh b́ k'azi? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Úts misho úts kúm ashosh t titsor b́ ooro ambts mari s'eene it k'aaúwi?» Bo were «Tatse git mari s'eena» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>«Mank'o shawat mishono awd kúm ashuwotssh t titsor oortso ambts mari s'eene it k'aaúwi?» Et boon bí aati. Bowere «Shawat mari s'eena» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Bíwere «Beree, andoor t'iwitsratsteya?» Bosh bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Betesayidn ááw dog asho b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Betesayid maantsowere ambobodtsok'on ashuwots dog iko Iyesus maants dek' boweyi, shodtsman b́ shuuítwok'o bok'oni. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Bíwere bek'falaw ashman b́ kisho detsdek't jishfere gálotse b́kishi, ashman ááwats s'udo tuf ett b́ kisho bíats gedt «Ik jago bek'irwiya?» ett bí aati.<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Ááw doogonu kááw dek't, «Ee ashuwots taash be'eyirune, ernmó shaíru mitwotsiye taash bo ariri,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Ando aani Iyesus asho aawwotsats b́ kisho b́ gedi, manoor ashman t'iwitsdek' b́ s'iili, kashatnu jam keewo s'ayintsdek't b́ bek'i. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Maniye il Iyesus «Galots kindk'aye,» ett b́ galomand bí ametuwok'o fakshb́k'ri.<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Mesihi b́ woto P'et'ros b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat. 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-20">Luk'. 9:18-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsn Filip'os K'isariya eteyiru dats kayu ganoke fa'a galwots maants botwi, weeratse bobefere Iyesus, «Ash ashuwots taan koni etfnó?» Ett b́ danifwotsi bí aati.<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Bowere, «Ik ikwots gupfo Yohansiye, k'atswots Eliyasiye, ando k'atswotswere nebiyiwotsitsi ikoniye etfne neesha,» ett bo aaniyi.<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yoh. 6:68-69</ref> </char>
    </note> «Itmo taan koni etfte?» ett bí aati. P'et'roswe «Nee he, Ik'o futtso neene,» ett bí aani.<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Iyesusere, «T jango konshor keewk'ayere,» ett kúp'shdek' boosh b́ izi.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'ironat k'irotse b́ twitwok'o tewrero b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat. 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk'. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Iyesus b́ danifwotsi hank'o ett daniyo dek'́ b́twi. «Ash na'o ay gond bek'o daatso bísh geyife, eenashwotsoke, kahni naashwotsnat Muse nemo danifwotsoke gac'etwe, úd'etwe, ernmó keez aawoniye okoon k'iro da'ar twitwe.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Keewano bek'shdek't boosh b́keewi, manóór P'et'ros bín bíaali ash aalok s'eegdek't fayo b́tuwi. «Hank'ó et k'aye» eton bín b́ fay. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Iyesusmó wongr ett aanat b́ danifwotsi s'ilt́ P'et'rosi, «Nee shed'anan t shutsomandan amee! nee ashka bako Ik'iko gawratsne!» ett b́ fay.<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos jafrats sha'o bíaatit wosho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:38-39">Mat. 10:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">16:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk'. 9:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:25-27">14:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk'. 14:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il Iyesus ash asho b́ danifwotsnton s'eegdek't boosh hank'o bí et, «T jafrats woo shuntso fa'e wotiyal b́ tooko juk'rowe, b́ mask'aliyono kurde'er tshuutso wowe, <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk'. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref> </char></note> B́ kashu faridek'o geyiru jamo bin t'ut'etwe, s'uznmó t jangonat doo shishiyi jangosh b́ kasho beshide imetwo fari dek'etwe, <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Asho dats jamatsi gaal jamo daatsrr b́ kasho b́t'ut'al eege bísh b́ k'aliti? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Asho b́ kashu woriyosh aak'o k'awntse dashosh b́ faliti? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Haalirwotsnat morrets, dúranatsi s'oot'anots shinatse taanat tkeewi jangosh jitsitu jamosh, ash na'o tnih mangon S'ayin melakiwotston t wóór b́ jangosh taawere jitsitwe.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aro b́wone woneyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat. 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk'. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Manatse tuut Iyesus, «Itsh aroniye tietiri and hanoke fa'anotsitse ik ikwots Ik'i mengstú een angnon b́ woor bobek'fetsosh k'irrawots fa'ane» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Shirt aawoniye il Iyesus P'et'rosi, Yak'obnat Yohansn s'uzi b́ shutsats dek't, gur ayidek't eeno abaats kesh b́dek'i, bo shinatsno bí aro wone b́ wutsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>B́ shemonu ayidek't golbwutsi, dats jik'atse konwor mashtso mankok'o mayde'er s'ayintso b́falawokó b́ wotefetso nas'buutsi. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Manoor Eeliyasnat Musen be'eyat Iyesusnton bokeewefere boosh bobe'eyi. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>P'et'rosuwe Iyesussh, «Danyirwono! hanoke beyo noosh sheenge, eshe iko neesh, iko Musesh, iko Eliyassh wotit keez gofwotsi awone» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>B́danif keezwots ayidek't boshattsotse P'et'eros b́ keewirwo danatse b́teshi.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk'. 3:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Dawnonu waat boon degb́dek'i, dawnotsno, «T shunts na'o haniye! bín k'ewere!» etiru k'ááro b́ shiyeyi. <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Manóóro wongr ett aanat bo s'iile boganoke Iyesus s'uzi bako konnor be'aatsno.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Guri abaatse bo oot'or Iyesus, «Ash na'o k'irotse b́ tuufetsosh it bek'tsan konshor keewk'ayere» ett boon bí azazi.<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>B́keewtsono k'ebdek't bo nibots detsbodek'i, wotowa bako «K'irotse tuwa etaan eega etek'úna?» ett bo atsatsewo bo keeweyi.<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat. 11:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Bowere, «Muse nemo daniyirwots Eliyasiye shino weetwoni bo etir eegoshe?» ett bo aati.<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Bíwere hank'o ett boosh bíaanyi, «Arikee, Eliyasiyere shino weetwe, unono káátsitwe, ernmó, ash na'o mangts gondbek'o b́ dek'etwonat b́ gac'etwok'on guut'etso aawk'one? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Taamó Eliyasiye shino waare, b́ jangosh guut'etsok'on ashuwots boshuntsok'o bíats k'alrne» etirwe itsha.<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kim shayiron detsets na'o b́ kashiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat. 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk'. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Iyesusnat b́ danif keezwotsn b́ danif ortswotsok aanat boowor ay ashuwots kakweyat boon gúúrdek't bo s'iili, Muse nemo danifwotsu b́ danifwotsnton bo moshfera bo teshi. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Ashjamo Iyesusi bobek'tsok'on adt bo tek'i, b́ maantsó wos't jamó bín bo aati. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Iyesuswere, «Bonton itmoosheyir eegi jange b́ teshi?» ett boon bíaat.<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Ashuwots dagotse iko hank'o ett bí aani, «Danifono, gidik' woshts gond shayiron detsetso t na'onee n maants dek'waare, <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Bíyatse b́ twoor bín dike b́dikfoni, b́ nonotse úmbo kisht b́ gasho b́ k'ashfoni, bí atsonwere duunok'o shuu'ini b́ wutsefoni, kim shayirmano bo kishish n danifwotsi aatre b́ teshi, ernmó falratsne.»<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bí eti, «It amaneraw ashaanots! awrish b́ borfetsone itnton t beeti? Awrish b́ borfetsone iti t k'amiti? Aab na'o t maants dowere!» <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Bowere na'o b́ maants dek'boweyi, kim shayirmanwere Iyesusi b́bek'tsok'on na'o dikdek't b́ s'ik'íyi, na'onwere datsats p'up'urefetst úmbó kisho dek'b́twi. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Iyesuswere na'o nihsh, «Shodan awre hake bín b́ detsi?» et bí aati. Nihonwere hank'o ett bí aani, «Marmat'on detstniye. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Úd'osho geeyat ayoto tawonat aatsots b́ fet'foni, ernmó k'alosh nfaliyal oona! noosh maac'o k'ewowe! nonowere tewu'e!»<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Iyesuswere, «N faliyala etfi? Amanit ashosh jam keewo faletwe!» bí bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Manoor na'o nih, «Amanonere amanitwe, ernmó amano tmawituu jam keewatse nee taan faliwee!» ett b́ kuhi.<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Iyesuswere ash ashuwots dimbirefetst bowaafe b́ bek'i, kim shayirmansh, «Nee dogonat gdik' wotts kim shayironó na'o atsotse n keshetwok'o anarnu bí atsots n kindrawok'o neen azazere!» ett b́ hadi.<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Kim shayironúwere k'aari eenon k'eet'at, na'ono ay dek't b́ s'ik'iyakon b́ keshi, na'onúwere duunok'o wotb́wtstsosh aywotssh k'irk arbwtsi. <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Ernmó Iyesus na'o kisho detsdek't tuuzbk'rí, na'onu tuut ned'b́wtsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Iyesuswere moots b́kindór b́ danifwots, «Eshe eegoshe kim shayiro noo kisho nomaawi?» ett bí aali boaati.<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Bíwere, «Han naaro Ik' k'ononat s'oomiyon b́ wotiyala bako k'oshon eegonor keyatse.» et boosh bíaany.<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ k'iri janogonat b́ tuwi jango gitlo b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk'. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsn beyokman k'azk'rat Gelil weeron boami, b́ beyokono konwor b́danetwok'o Iyesus geeratse b́tesh, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Man b́wottsonwere Iyesus b́ danifwotssh, «Ash na'o ashuwots kishots besheyar ímetwe, bo were bín úd'itúne, úd'eyakonmo keezl aawots tuwitwe.» etfetst boon b́daniri b́ tesh.<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>B́ danifwotsmó keewan t'iwintsde'atsno, bo aatrawok'oyisho shatbowtsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jamoniyere bogo kone?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk'. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwots K'frnahom maants bo waa, Iyesus moots b́ kindihakon b́ danifwotssh, «Weratse waafetsat it mooshiru keewo eebi b́teshi?» et boon bíaati. <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk'. 22:24</ref> </char></note> Eree bomó s'ik et bobeyi, manwere weratse bo befere, «No únetsitse bogo kone?» et bo mooshfere boteshtsotsna. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Bíwere be b́dek'iyakon tatsegitwotsi s'eegdek't, «Konwor wotowa asho shintso wotosh b́geyiyal únoniyere shuuts wotáár únosho guuts woto bín geytwe» bí et. <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Na'í marmat' iko dek'wat bodagots ned'í bík'ri, gep'dek'tnu boosh hank'o bí et, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat. 10:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk'. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref> </char></note> «Nana'anotsitse ikok'o t shúútsosha err dek'etwo taano dek'etwe, taano dek'etu jamo taan b́woterawo taan woshtso dek'etwe.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Noon shid'aw jamoniye noonton ike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk'. 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohans Iyesussh, «Danifono ash ikoniye n shúútson fo'erawo b́kishfere nobek'i, ernmó, noonton wotob́k'aztsotse bazirone» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Mannowere Iyesus hank'o bí et, «T shúútson adits keewo finefetsr manóór ti atsats gondo keewitwo bí altsotse k'ayk'rore, bazi k'ayere, <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat. 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk'. 11:23</ref> </char></note> Noon k'eferaw jamó nontoniye, <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat. 10:42</ref> </char></note> Aroniye itsh ti etiri, Krstosk it wottsosh t shúútsosh dab́ aats ik brc'k'o itsh ishitwo b́ k'awntso t'ud'atsee» bíet.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashosh t'ug wotatse ats kordk'o b́ geyitwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat. 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk'. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>«Konwor asho taan amaniru nana'a múk'anotsitse ikosh t'ug b́ wotoniyere di' shúts mango b́bimbats tífde'er aats k'arots b́ juwewo k'anefe. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat. 5:30</ref> </char></note> Mansh n kishu neesh t'ugo bwotiyal k'ut'de juk'rowe! git kisho deshfetsr gahanemits n juwewoniye kish k'ut' wotar kash weero maants n kindo k'anefe. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Gahanem b́ shipir ash maafo k'irraka, b́ taawo tahraw beyoke. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>N tufo neesh t'ugo b́ wotitkawotiyal, k'ut'de juk'rowe, git tufo deshfetsr gahanemits n juwewoniyere, dúr wotar kashomaants nkindo neesh k'anefe. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Gahanem b́ shipro k'irrawo, b́ tawo tahraw beyoke.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat. 5:29</ref> </char></note> Ni ááwonwere neesh t'ugo b́wotitka wotiyal kishde juk'rowe, git ááwo deshfetsr Gahanemits n juwewoniyere ik ááwetso wotar Ik'i mengstots kindo neesh k'anefe. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isa. 66:24</ref> </char></note> Gahanemitse ash mááf shipro k'irraka, b́ tawonwere tahrakee. <verse eid="MRK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Wosho beeron b́ s'aynfok'o, asho ik ikon tawon s'ayno bín geyitwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk'. 14:34-35</ref> </char></note> Beero sheenge, ernmó, beeri shaawo b́t'út'al eegneyá bín it shawshiti?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">«Ititsere shuneyi beeri shaawo beewe, it atsastewo ik wotarr jeenon beewere,» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Máátsunat kenihon faksheyi jangosh Iyesus b́ danitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat. 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk'. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Iyesus manoke tuut, Yordanos fokoniye bak'etsonat Yihud datso maants bí ami. Aydek't ayts asho aani b́maants ko'ee b́wtsi, bíwere bali b́k'alfok'owa b́danyfo.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Fersawino eteetswotsitse k'atswots bíyok t'iinbodek'i, bín fado geeyat, «Asho máátso b́fakshitwk'o nemotse fa'áá?» ett bín bo'aati.<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Iyesuswere, «Muse keewan jango iti bí'azaztso eebi?» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Iwi. 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat. 5:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Bowere, «Museyiyere bin b́fakshtsok'o kitsit work'ato ímr b́ fakshitwok'o wotowe etre» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaani, «Museyiyere tzaziyan itsh b́ guut' it maac'o kup'at bíere shisho itk'aynee, <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Aze. 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref> </char></note> ernmó shintson azeetswotsi bíazor dek' b́ tuutsok'on ‹Ik'o nungushonat máátson woshdek'tni bíaziye. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Mansha asho b́ nihnat bí indn k'ayr b́ máátsunton ike b́wotiti. <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-8</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aze. 2:24</ref> </char></note> Gitwotswere ik atse bowotitye,› maniyehako git bowoto b́ oorere ike bowotiti. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Eshe Ik'o ik b́ woshtso asho k'alk'aye.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Moo maants bo aanor b́ danifwots keewman jango aani Iyesusi bo aati.<verse eid="MRK 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11-12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 K'or. 7:10-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Bíwere hank'o ett boosh bíaany, «B́ máátsu fakshr k'osh mááts dek'etwo b́ máátsu ats dabt dek'ts gobetso wotere, <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Mank'ó b kenihatse faksheyar k'osh nungushosh mááts ametuwú bíwere gobetsu woteraniye etee.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus nana'uwotsi b́ deertsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk'. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Boon b́ shuíítwok'o nana'o Iyesusok dek'tboweyi, ernmó b́ danifwots nana'a dek'weyirwotsi bo hadi. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Iyesuswere man b́bek'tsok'on b́ danifwotsi fayat hank'o boosh bíet, «Ik'i mengstu hanotsk'owwotssh b́wottsotse k'ayere nana'uwots tiyok wone, boon bazik'ayere, <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat. 18:3</ref> </char></note> Aarikoniye itsh ti etiri, na'ok'o wotar Ik'i mengstu de'aawo b́jamon bits kindratse.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Maniye il nana'uwotsi matdek't b́ kisho bo ats geddek't boon b́ deeri.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaalets ash iko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk'. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Iyesus manoke kesht amoke b́befere ash iko b́maand wos'fere waat b́ shinatse tuk'maldek't, «Doo danífono, dúre dúri kasho daatsosh eeg k'alo taash geyifa?» ett bín bí aati. <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bísh bí aaniy, «Eegoshe doono taash nieetírí? Ik' ikoniye okoon konúwor dówó aaliye, <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kesh. 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Iwi. 5:16-20</ref> </char></note> B́ tzaziwotsi danfnee, boowere, ‹Úd'k'aye, gobo amk'aye, úmp'k'aye, kooto gawk'aye, dirshk'aye, n nihnat nindn mangiwe› eteetswotsiye.»<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Ashmanwere, «Danifono, tzazi hanotsi na'ortson kotdek're» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Iyesuswere bín s'iilt shunbk'ri, et hank'o bísh bíet, «Neesh ortsu ik keew fa'ane, amee, ndetsts jáámo kemr n gizo tugretswotssh ime, ko'ííyets gaalo darotse daatsitune, manyere hakon t shutsats wowe» <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Ashmanwere man b́shishtsok'on shiyanon b́ shiitso aak'bwutsi, aydek't detstsi b́ wottsosh shiyanefere k'az bíami.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Iyesus wongret aanat b́ danifwotsi s'iilt, «Gaaletsosh Ik' mengstots kindo aak'o kic'ike!» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>B́ danifwots b́keewman shisht bo adi, Iyesusmó aani hank'owa bí et, «Nanawotso! Ik' mengsto maants kindo aak'o kic'itke! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Gaalets asho Ik' mengtots b́ kindoniyere kambulo mafi fúrotse b́ besho ketefee.»<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>B́ danifwots ayidek't adt, «Béré hank'on kone fal kashitwoni?» ett bo atsatseyo bo'aateyi.<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Iyesus bomaand s'iilt, «Arikon keewan ashuwotssh faleratse, Ik'oshmó faletwe, Ik'oshe jám keew falefe» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>P'et'roswere, «Hamb, noo úno k'azk'rat n jafratse waarone» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bí aani, «Aaroniye itsh ti etírí, t jangonat dooshishiyi jangosha ett b́ moo, wee b́ eshuwotsi, b́ mishotsi, b́ indi wee b́ nihi, wee b́na'ó, wee b́ detstso k'azet asho bogo daatsitwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>Dúranatsnoor gisheyonton dab́ moowwotsi, bí eshwotsi, b́ mishuwotsi, b́ nana'o, b́ taaronowere bal kisho daatsitwe, weyiru datsatsno dúre dúri beyo daatsitwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat. 20:16</ref> </char></note> Wotowa eree shinatse fa'a aywotsitse shuutstsi wotitune, shutsts teshtswotswere shintsi wotitune.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ k'iritwok'onat k'irotse b́ tuwi jango keezlo shini b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk'. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Iyerusalem maants daamet weerindatse bosha'efere, Iyesus bo shin shinatsa b́ sha'iri b́tesh, b́ danifwotswere keewanatse tuutson bo adi, b́ shutsatse weyirwotsu shat bowtsi. Aaninwere tatsegitwotsi bíyok t'intsdek't, bí ats bodet keewi jango hank'o ett boosh b́ keewi, <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>«Hamb Iyerusalem maants amishee no etiri, Ash na'oniye kahni naashwotsnat Muse nemo daniyrwotssh beshide'er imetwe, boowere k'iri keewo bí ats angshitune, Ik'i ash woterawwotssh beshide'er imetúnee, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Ik'i ash woterawotswere bí ats kaashetúne, bíats s'udetune, bíno jot'etune, úd'itune, ernmó keezl aawoniye okoon tuwitwe.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yak'obnat Yohansn bo k'on k'ono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat. 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Zebdiwos nanauots Yak'obnat Yohansn Iyesusok t'int, «Danifono, neen nok'onitu jamo noosh nk'alitwok'o geefone» bo et.<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Bíwere, «Itsh eeg tk'ale it geyi?» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Bowere, «N mengsti mangotse noyitsi iko n k'ano maants noyitsi iko n giromaants no beetwok'o alo noosh ime» bo et.<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk'. 12:50</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesusmó, «It it k'onírwo danatste, taa t úshet gond bek'i wanc'o úsho falituteya? Taa t gupet gupewono it fal gupeetuteya?» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Bowere, «Ee, falitwone,» bo eti. Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bí eti, «Arikee taa t úshet gond bek'i wanc'o úshetute, taa t gupet gupewono gupetute, <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>ernmó t giromaantsonat k'anomaants beyo imetwo taanaliye, han boosh ímeetwots Ik'o boosh b́k'anítswots s'uzshe.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Oorts tatswots man shisht Yak'obnat Yohansats fayo dek'botuwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42-43 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Luk'. 22:25-26</ref> </char></note> Iyesus jamwotsi b́ maants s'egdek'et boosh hank'o b́ eti, «Ik' ash woteraw ashuwotsats naashtswots, ash k'eezirwotsi err s'egeyirwok'onat bo jishirwotswere bo atse alo bo detstsok'o danfte, <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>ititsnomó mank'o woto geyiratse, it dagotse een wotó geyirwo, it guuts woto bísh geyife, <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Mank'o ititse jamoniye shintso woto geyirwo jamosh guuts wotowe. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Ash Na'oniyere ashuwotssh finonat b́ kashu ay ashuwots bin bokashit k'awntso woshde'er ímosha b́ weyi bako bísh bofinitwok'o waratse.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ááw dogo Bert'elemiwosi b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk'. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́ danifwotsnton Iyariko kito maants b́ weyi. Beshatnu kitotse kesht bí amor ayidek't ay ashuwots b́ jafrats bo sha'efera botesh, T'imewos naay Bert'elemiwosi eteets ááw dog ash iko weeri gúúratse bedek't k'ono b́ k'onfera b́ tesh. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Nazrettso Iyesus man weeron b́ beshirwok'o danb́k'rtsok'on, «Dawit naay Iyesuso, oona neesha! taash maac'ó k'ewowe!» etfets kuho dek't b́twi.<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Aaywotsu, «S'ik eree!» ett bín bo hadi, bímó, «Dawit naayo aage! Oona neesha maac'o taash k'ewowe!» etfetst aydek't bogshdek't b́ kúhi.<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Iyesuwere need'dek't, «Bín s'eere!» bí eti, boowere dogosh, «Eree kup'owe! tuuwe! Iyesusiye neene b́s'egiri!» bo et.<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Bíwere b́ shemó juuk'rat t'oolat tuut Iyesusmaants bíami.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Iyesuswere, «Neesh eeg tk'alish geefi?» ett bín bí aati. Ash ááwu dogonwere, «Daniyrwono! oona neesha! ti'ááwo b́ bek'etwok'o taash woshwe,» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Iyesuswere, «Eree! amee, n imnetiyoniye neen kashire,» bí eti. Ashmanwere manoor bek'o b́fali, weerindono Iyesus shuutso shoy dek't b́ tuwi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus mangi eenon Iyersalemits b́ kindo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk'. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsn Iyerusalem maants t'infe boowor Bete Fagenat Bitaniya eteets dats weeron waat Debrezeyit gurok bo bodi, Maniyako Iyesus b́ danifwotsitse gitwotssh hank'o ett b́ woshi, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>«It shinatse fa'a galuts shino ameree, bíyok it bodtsok'on konúwor ik asho bíyats kesh b́ danaw daazna'o tipetso daatsitute, bíno biishde'er hakan de'ewore. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Konwor asho ‹Eegishe han it k'aliri?› bí'etala ‹Doonzosh b́ geytsotsnee erere, manoró aani doyitwe,› erere.»<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Bowere amt daaz na'aman weeri gúúratse maa úratse tipetsok'on daatst bobitsi. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Manoor manoke need'dek't teshts ashuwotsitse ik ikwots «Daazna'o it biitsir eegoshe?» ett bo aati.<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Bowere Iyesus boosh b́ keewtso bo keewi, ashuwotsu k'az bok'r. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>B́ danifwotsu daazna'o Iyesus maants dek'boweyi, bo tahono daazna'o jik'ats bo geere Iyesus bíats beeb́dek'i. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Ash aywotswere bo shemo weeratsa bo es'fera bo tesh, k'atswotswere bodootse maarets miti jaabo k'ut'dek't werindatsa bo es'fera boteshi. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Dub. 118:25-26</ref> </char></note> Shin shinats beshtswotsnat shutsatse shoy dek't weyiru jamwots, «Hosa'ana! Doonzo shútson wetwóniye deereke! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Weyiru nonih Dawit mengestu deerekiye! darotsno hosa'ana!» ett bo kúhi.<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Iyesuswere Iyersalemi b́ bodtsok'on Ik'i moots b́ kindi, gúúrmanatse fa'a keew jamo b́ s'ííli, datsonu b́'iltsotse tatse gitwotsnton Iyerusalemitse kesht Betaniy maants bí ami.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ c'ashts belesi mitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat. 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Yaatsok'ono Betaniyere bo aanor Iyesus k'ak'bwtsi. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Bmaaró atts belesi mitu wokoon bek't daneraka shuwo biyatse b́datseyala et bmaand bí ami, ernmó bmaand b́ t'inor belesi shuwo b́ borafa'otse maaroniye okoon eegor biyatse daatsratse. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Mansho Iyesus belesi mitush, «Haniyak konwor ni atse shuwo maak'aye!» bí et.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Han b́ keewferowere b́ danifwots boshishi.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik'i mootse jaakirwotsi b́ kishtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk'. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Iyerusalemits bobodtsok'on Ik'i moots kindt bítse kemirwotsnat keewiru ashuwotsi kisho dek' b́twi, giz wonyirwots t'arap'ezonat kúrkúnd kemirwots jorwotsi b́ gúp'shi, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Asho konnor b́ wotiyal, eegi naari k'ac'o b́ wotiyalor, kurde'er Ik' k'oni maa manitse b́sha'erawok'o b́baziyi. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erm. 7:11</ref> </char></note> Hank'o ett boon b́ daniy, « ‹T moo ash jamosh Ik' k'oni maa etitwe!› ett gut'eratsa? Itmo bik'tswotssh goop'ee it woshi.»<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Kahni naashwotsnat Muse nemo danyrwots man b́keewfere bo shishi, ash jamonu b́ daniru danmaanatse tuutson adt boteshtsotse bín shatbowtsi, mann aak'ok'alde'er bín bo t'afiyet malo bo geefera botesh.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Datsonwere b́ iltsok'on Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsn kitotse k'az bokeshi.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Belesi mítú atse tuutson daatsets dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat. 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Yaats guurok'on weeron beshefetst belesi mit man b s'ap'onton shuuk'wtsat biere bobek'i. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>P'et'roswere keewman gawdek't Iyesussh «Danifono! hambe, n c'ashts mitú shuuk' wtserane» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bí eti, «Ik'one amanore, <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 K'or. 13:2</ref> </char></note> Aarikoniye itsh ti etiri, konwor asho b́ nibotse b́ nibon amanar b́geyiyal keew jamo bísh b́wotitwok'o amanar, guran ‹Hanoke tuur aats k'arots shap'ewe,› bí'etal bísh wotitwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Eshe itsh keewirwe, Ik' k'onon konnari keewonor it k'oniyal itsh k'alk'retsok'o woshr amanore, it k'oniru jamone itsh ímetwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25-26</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:14-15">Mat. 6:14-15</ref> </char></note> Darotse fa'o itnih it morro itsh oorowe bí etetwok'o, itwere k'onosh itned'or, asho ik keewon iti irire wotiyal bísh orowa erere. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>It k'oshwots fints morro boosh orowe eto itk'azalmó darotse fa'o it nih it fints morrosh itshor orowe eraatse.»]<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kon alon b́ finirwok'o aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk'. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Aaninwere Iyerusalem maants boweyi, Iyesuswere Ik' mootse ananoke b́befere kahni naashwots, Muse nemono danifwotsnat eenash eenashwotsn b́ maants waat́ <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>«Keewanotsi n finir kon aloneya?» himó keewanotsi n k'alitwok'o alo neesh imtso kone? ett bín boaati.<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'owa bí et, «Taawere iti ik keewo aatitwe, it taash it aaniyal, taawere keewanotsi kon alon t k'alirwok'o itsh keewitwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Yohans gupo Ik'okike moo ashokike? Aab taash anyibe'ere,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Bowere, «And eshe eega erono?» Eton boatsatsewo shiyewo dek't botwi, « ‹Ik'okne› no etal ‹Beree eegoshe bín amano itk'azi?› eteetwe, <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>‹Ashokike,› no eetale?» Mank'o bo erawok'o ash jamo Yohansi arikon nebiyiye bo eetfosh shatbowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Mansha, «Noo danatsone.» ett bo aani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Iyesuswere, «Béré taawor kon alon keewanotsi tfinirwok'oo itsh keeweratse,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Woyini mitwotsi goshfwotsn ariyets jewro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk'. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Manats dabt Iyesus jewron hank'o ett keewo dek' b́ tuwi «Ash ikoniye weyinyi mito b́toki, b́ gúúrono b́ kas'i, woniyo fíís'osh wotit gop'ono ishdekt dóóz b́k'́ri, woyniwo kotoosh wotit ayidekt eents gmbyi kako agb́k'ri, maniyere hakon mítwots datsman goshtswotssh shiro imk'rat wok datso k'azbíami. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Shuwo b́bodtsok'on, woyni shuwotse bísh bodowetwok'o b́ guutso goshtswotsok b́ woshi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Goshtswotsmó b́ guutso detsdek't tog bo ishihak kishi baashon damiy bok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Doonzo aani k'osh guutso b́woshi, goshtsmanots manowere fas'dek't́ ketidek't bo damyi. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Aaninu k'osho b́woshere úd'bok'ri, mank'o ayuwotsi b́woshere, ik ikotsi bo togi, k'oshwotsno bo úd'i. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>And k'alosh bísh ortso b́ shunts na'o wosho s'uzi b́ tesh, mansh ‹Tnayi mangiyo k'ayatsne› ett gawdek't s'uwi aawatse b́ naay b́ woshi. <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Ernmó goshtswots bo atsatsewo ‹Han eshe naatetwoniye! woore bín úd'k'rone! b́ naato noosh wotitwe› bo eti. <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Mann detsdek't bo úd'i, woyiny mit beyok manoke kish dek't ur juubok'ri.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>«Eshe weyni doonzo eege b́ k'aliti k'una? doonzo b́tookon weetwe, gooshtswotsno úd'itwe, weyni mitmano k'oshwotsish imk'ritwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10-11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Dub. 118:22-23</ref> </char></note> Eshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‹Gmby agfwots bo gac'ts shútso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">Bíwere shúts kup'o shúts jamwotsi tungúshatse kaatsde detset shúts wot b́wtsi,<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Manúwere doonzo fínk fínee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">no ááwoshowere adike›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">etirwo S'ayin mas'aafotse nababeratsteya?»<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Ayhudi naashwots Iyesus jewrdek't b́ keewtsman boon s'iilitk b́woto t'iwints dek't danbok'rtsosh bín deshdek'o bo geyi, ernmó ashjamo shatt k'azk'rat bo ami.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ereer dashi jango aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk'. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Ferisawiwotsi eteefwtsnat Herodis jirwotsitse wotts ik ik ashuwots Iyesusi b́ noon keew keewon detsosh b́ maants bo wosheyi. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Bíyok t'iintnwere bísh hank'o boeti, «Danifono, neehe ar keewtso nwotonee danfone, ash shatonat eege taash eteti eton nfints keewo aaliye, Ik'i weerindono aronee n daniyiri, eshe, Rom nugúsosh ereer dasho niwe moo? Niwaalne? Ereerwonomo ereerk'ayono?» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Iyesuswere git alberetswotsi bowottsok'o dan k'rat «Eegoshe taan detso itgeyiri? Aab ambarman dewar taash kitswere,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Bowere ambaro bísh dek't boweyi, bíwere «Ambarmanatse fa'a arunat bíyats guut'ets shúútsu konkne?» ett bíaati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bowere «Rom nugúsoke,» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Iyesuswere «Béré nugúsoko nugúsosh, Ik'oko Ik'osh ímeree,» ett boosh bíaaniy. Bowere bíaany anyatse tuutson bo'adi.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'irtswots k'irotse tuwi jangosh aateetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk'. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Wosh. 23:8</ref> </char>
    </note> «K'írtswots tuwo aaliye,» etef Seduk'awino eteefwots Iyesus maants waat́ hank'o ett bo aati, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Iwi. 25:5</ref> </char></note> «Danyfono, ‹Ash iko na'o b́shuurawon k'iron b́máátsuatse b́k'aleyetka wotiyal bí eshu máátsmani de'er k'írtso shaato shegrshwee,› ett Muse noosh guut're. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Eshe, shawat eshwwots fa'ano bo teshi, jam manotssh k'aabo máátso dek't na'o b́ shuurawon k'írb́wtsi, <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Bo eshu gitlonu máátsmani dek't́ na'o b́shuurawon k'irb́wutsi, keezlonwere mank'ó wotb́wtsi, <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Mank'oon shawat eshwots bin dek't shááto boshegrishrawon k'irbos'uwi, jamoniyere il ando máátsman k'irbwtsi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Shawat eshwots tar taron bín dek'rneree, eshe k'irtswots bo twoor aawshe mááts bwotiti?»<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaany, «It it shelir S'ayn mas'afwotsnat Ik'i angon it dartsoshe? <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>K'irtswotsiyere botwor darotse beyiru melakiwotskok'owa bowotiti bako de'aatsnó de'eratsne. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kesh. 3:6</ref> </char></note> K'irotse tuwi janga wotiyal Ik'o Musesh buushitsi tawotse eeg bísh b́keewtsok'o Muse mas'aafotse nababeratsteya? Manwere ‹Taa Abraham Ik'o, Yisak' Ik'o, Yak'ob Ik'o taane,› bí ettsoniye. <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Mansha Ik'o kashetswots Ik'a bako k'irtswots Ik'aliye, it imó ayidek'atniye it sheliri.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jamoniyere bogts tzazyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat. 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk'. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:28-34 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk'. 10:25-28</ref> </char>
    </note> Muse nemo daniyirwotsitse iko bomooshirman b́k'ebfera b́teshi, Iyesus sheengshdek't boosh bíaanitsok'ó nem danifman t'iwintsb́dek'i, Iyesus maants t'iindek't «Jamoniye bog tzaziyo aawne?» ett b́aati.<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Ieyesuswere hank'ó ett bísh bíaanyi, «Jamoniye bogts tzaziyo ‹Isra'elo! shiye, Izar Izewer no Ik'oniye ik Ik'e,› <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29-30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Iwi. 6:4-5</ref> </char></note> Neewere Doonzo Izar Izeweri n maac' s'eenon, n be jamon, nnib s'eenon, ni angi s'eenon shune, etirwonye. <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref> </char></note> Han arts gitl tzaziyoniye, ‹k'osh asho n tokok'o woshde'er shune,› etirwoniye. Gitetsanotsiyere k'osho bogts tzaziyo aaliye.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Iwi. 4:35</ref> </char></note> Muse Nemo danifonwere Iyesussh hank'o bíet «Sheenge, danifono! ‹Ik'oniye ike, bíye oko Izar Izewer k'osho aaliye› etaat nkeewtsoniye aree. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref> </char></note> Mansh asho Ik'o maac' s'eenonn, b́ be jamon, nib s'eenon, ang s'eenon shunonat k'osh asho b́ tokok'ó woshde'er shuno bísh geyife, tawats mitsr s'uwiyet wosho t'itsonat k'osh wosho Ik'osh t'intsoniyere git tzaziyanotsi koto boǵfee.»<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Iyesuswere Muse Nemo danifman danitelefonat t'iwitson bíaanitsok'ó bek't «Neehe Ik'i mengstuuke wokk neenaliye» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Maniye hakon Iyesusi aatosh ááwu shuuk'tso konwor aali.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesihiyo jango aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-46">Luk'. 20:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Iyesus Ik' mootse danifetst hank'o ett bíaat, «Muse nemo danyirwots ‹Mesiyo Dawit naayiye,› bo etír eegoshe? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char></note> Dawit b́tookish S'ayn shayiron jisheyat</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‹Ik'o t doonzsh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">N balangarwotsi n tufi shirots neesh t gerfetsosh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">T k'ani aaromand beewe,› etre.<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Dawit b́ tookon ‹Doonza› et b́s'eegiyakon eshe, Krstos Dawitsh aak'oneya b́ naay b́ wotiti?» Ay ashuwotsu gene'úona bín bok'ebiri botesh.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muse nemo danfwotsnat ferisawiwotsatse bo atso kotiyetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk'. 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Iyesus b́ daniyor hank'o etre, «Tahi geenz geenzo karde hake bako gúúro, gawyotsno mangts jamo dek'osh shunírwots Muse nemo danyfwotsatse it atso kode'ere, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Bo ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse mangts jooro, móónat úshi beyokno mang beyoko daatsoshe bogeefoní. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Be'ewosh bo t'intsiru geenzide Ik' k'ononwere webdek't kenih k'irts máátswots detstso bo bik'foni, mansh boon bog angshe kotiri.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">T'oo máátsu im imo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk'. 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Iyesus giz ko'iyeyiru sat'ni shinatse b́ beewor ashasho sat'nots gizo bo fet'fere s'iilfetst b́teshi, gaalets ayuwots ay gizo bo gedfere bo teshi, <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>T'oow mááts iku waat git santim wotit k'azwotsi manits dabbk'ri. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Iyesus b́ danifwotsi s'eegdek't hank'o bíet, «Aroniye itsh tietiri, sat'nots giz gedts ash jamwotsitse bogsh dek' gedtsuniye t'owu máátsaniye. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>K'oshwots bo jamets bo ímiye bo detstsotse s'eent oortsoniye, bimó tugrets wotefetsat eegonor b orirawo b detsts jamo imraniye.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik' moo b́ gaahitwok'o b́ keewtsok'ó</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk'. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Iyesus Ik' mootse keshfetst b́ danifwotsitse iko, «Danifonó, shútsanotsnat gmbiyanotsn s'ííle, adiknee!» bíeti <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Iyesuswere «Gmbi een eenanotsi bek'irwiya? Shúts jamanots gaahitune, shútsats shútso kos'eyarr ooritwo aaliye,» ett bísh bíaany.<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dúrí s'uwi milikito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk'. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Iyesus Ik' maa shinatse fa'a Debrezeyit guri abaatse b́befere P'et'rosu, Yak'obu, Yohansnat Indriyasn bo aal b́ maants t'iindek't <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>«Keewan b́wotitwo awre? Jaman wotosh b́t'ínor b́ mlkito eebi? Aab noosh keewwe» eton boaati.<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaani, «Konwor iti b́darirawok'o it tooko korde'ere, <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Ayuwotsiye ‹Taa Krstos taane!› etfere t shútson wetuune, ay ashono daritune, <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>It ganoke kes'o kes'ewonat kes'i jango it shishor tek' k'ayere, jaman b́woto oreratse, ernmó manoor dúri s'uwo borafa'ee. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Ash asho bíaatsatseyo, mengsto mengstats kes'o tuuzitwe, dats datsatse dats shek'ewonat k'ak'on wotitwe, jaman na'a it'í kic'o b́twortsok'o kic'e.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9-11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mat. 10:17-20</ref> </char>
    </note> «Itwere it tookish it tooko korde'ere, ashuwots iti moosh moosheyirwok beshide'er ímetúne, ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootsnowere iti jot'etnee, gawo taash it wotitwok'o alirwotsnat naash naashwots shinats angshosh ned'itute. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Ernmó jaman b́woteftsere shino dooshishiyo datsjamatsi ashjamosh bodo bín geyife. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Ashuwots iti deshde angshosh bo t'intsor, ‹Eebí nokewiti k'úna?› err shiyank'ayere, S'ayin shayironi bako itnaliye keewiti. Eshnee, manóór itsh bí ímts mec'ro keewwere. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Eshuwo bíeshuwi, niho b́na'o k'irosh beshide'er ímetwe, nana'onu bo ind nihats tuwitúne, bonowere úd'itune. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat. 10:22</ref> </char></note> Teshútsosha err ash jamoke shit'eek wotitute, ernmó k'amde'e b́s'uufetso kup'itwoniye kashitwe.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kic'iyit gondbek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat. 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk'. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>«Ando daatseyo bín b́geyiraw beewoke t'afo dowet wic'its keewo bek'etute, hanowere nababirwo t'iwintsde'a manóór Yihud datsatse fa'uwots guromants woc'nee, <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15-16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk'. 17:31</ref> </char></note> Maa tookats keshdk't fa'o ood'r mootse ik keewo dek'osh moots kindk'aye. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Tarotse fa'onu b́ shemdek'o shuuts aank'aye. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Manóór na'i maac'wotsnat s'aats ishiru na'i indwotsnsh indowe boosha! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Jaman joshon b́woterawok'o Ik'o k'onwore. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Bek'. 7:14</ref> </char></note> Man dúr, Ik'o datso bí'azortson tuut andish b́borfetso be'e danerawo gond bek'o wotitwe, shinomaantsishor mank'óó kic'o b́jamon boratse. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Doonzo aaw manotsi k'awintso b́k'azink'ere konwor kasho falrawnk'e, ernmó marat'ets ashuwotssha eteere aawmanots k'awnetúne.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>«Eshé konwor wotowa ‹Krstos hambe hanokna!› Wee ‹Ekebe ekewokna!› itsh bí'etal bín amank'ayere. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Kootets kirstosotsnat kootets nebiyiwots weetúne, bo boosh b́faleyink'ere marat'etswotswor dab́ bo orerawo dariyosh adits keewo finitúne. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hzk'. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Iyu. 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Bek'. 6:12</ref> </char></note> Jam keewo itsh shino keewre eshe it tooko korde'ere.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos aaniyi b́weyi jango b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk'. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>«Manoori aawwotsitse, gond bek'maniye il, aawu t'alwitwa, aashitsnu bshaano imatsaniye, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa. 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Iyu. 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Bek'. 6:13</ref> </char></note> K'eenwotsu daaratse fed' s'wituno, daaratse beyiru angwotswere giwwtsituno. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bek'. 1:7</ref> </char></note> Maniyere hakon Ash Na'o een angonat een mangon daawnon b́ wááfere bek'etwe, <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>B́ melakiwotsno woshitwe, boowere awd kaaton amr datsonat dari deshok b́borfetso fa'úwotsi, bísh marat'ets ashuwotsi kakwitúno.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzoko kitsit belesi mitú ariyetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk'. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>«Belesi mitú s'ílde'e biatse dande'ere, bjabwots k'uk'o botworonat bo maarwots bo atóór manoor k'aawo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maari ata: </char><char style="ft">Keewetsan biitso b́ kitsir mitwotsatse maaro boc'r bí atfo k'aawon b́wotoniye. </char></note> b́t'intsok'o danetute. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Mank'ó itwere jaman b́woto itbek'oor Ash Na'o weet aawo, waat maa úratse b́ karntsok'o dande'ere, <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Arikoniye itsh tietiri, and shuwetsanots bobeshefetsere jaman s'eenetwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Daronat datson beshituno, ti aap'tsonmó b́jamon besheratse.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo b́ weet aawonat sa'aton konúwor danatse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat. 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat. 24:36</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ernomó aawman jango nihoniyere okoon konwor dantso aaliye, darotsi melakiwotswor danatsne, naayonwor danatse. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>B́ sa'ato awr b́wotitwok'o itdanawotse it tooko korde'ere, kup'ore. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk'. 12:36-38</ref> </char></note> Manúwere, b́moo k'azk'rat wok datso amts ashoni bíari, bíwere b́gutswotsi ik ikon finats b́ naashiyi, bísh kotfono kup'de b́ kotetwok'o bísh b́ keewi. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Eshe moo doonz b́weet aawo it danawotse it tooko korde'ere, wee kooc'omand, wee taali titsa, wee baaki k'adore, weyinmó guur weetwe, <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Gawerawo wáárr k'eyoke iti b́ daatsrawok'o kup'ore.<verse eid="MRK 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>«Itsh t keewtsok'o, k'osh jametswots jangoshor kup'ore! etirwe.»<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusatsats máleets málo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk'. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-7">Kesh. 12:1-7</ref> </char>
    </note> Ayhudi fazigi baaliyonat tushmeyi baaliyo mangiyosh git aawo oorat b́ befere, kahni naashwotsnat Muse Nemo danifwotsn, Iyesusi malon deshde'er boúd'it málo bo geyiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Ernomó ash ashuwots fayo tuzitune ett «Baaliyi aawon han k'alratsone,» bo eti.<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats shitú fuutts máátsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk'. 7:37-38</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus Bitaniya eteets datsatse een shodon detseyat teshtso Simon mootsna b́ tesh. Mishimaratsnó t'int b́befere, mááts iku b́ k'awntso ayidek't shaaw wottsonat mangts Nardosi shitúwo biitse s'eentso, Albast'rosiya eteets shútson dozets blk'at'iyo dek'at bweyi, blk'at'iyo titsat shitúwo Iyesus tookats kuut'bk'ri. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Manoke fa'úotsitse ik ikwots wotts keewmaanatse tuutson fayat, «Shitúwan dats mec'ro eegoshe bíawashiti? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Shitúwan kemeyink'ere ik asho ik nato fiinar b́ daatsit k'awntsoniyere bogosh kemde'er gizman t'owwotssh ímo faleyank'e b́teshi!» et bo atsatsewo bo keeweyi, máátsno bo bak'ni.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Ernmó Iyesus hank'owa bí et, «K'ayere Biina! eegoshe bin itkic'iri? Biye taash sheeng keewo k'alraniye, <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Iwi. 15:11</ref> </char></note> T'owwots jam aawo itnton bo wottsosh it geyor boosh sheengo k'alosh falitute, ernmó jam aawo taan itoke daatsratste, <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Máátsaniye bfaltso k'alrane, t meetso b́ dukeftsre shini k'aniyosh shitúwo futrane. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Aro itsh keewirwe, dats jik' jamatse doo shishyetsoki beyok jamoke, taash bk'altsann bin gawetwok'o bish keewetwe.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yihud Iyesusi beshidek't imosh keewe b́k'rtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk'. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Tatse gitwotsitse iko, Ask'rot datstso Yihud Iyesusi beshide imosh kahni naashwots maants bí ami. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Bowere man dan bodek'ortsok'on gene'úbowtsi, gizono bísh ímetwone bo eti. Bíwere Iyesusi beshide ímosh k'ants aawo b́ kotfera b́tesh.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ayhudiy fazigi kooc' misho b́danifwotsnton B́ maatsok'oo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk'. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Fazig mereero bo shukeet tushmeyi baaliyi aaw shintsots, b́ danifwots Iyesusok t'int, «Fazigi kooc' misho móósh aawok amr neesh nok'aniyishe n geyeyi?» et bín bo aati.<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Iyesuswere b́ danifwotsitse gitwotsi hank'o et b́ woshi, «Kito maants ameree, manokno aats koro kuriru asho daatsitute, b́ jafrats ameree, <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>B́ kindit moots amr moo doonzosh, ‹Danyfo, t danifwotsnton fazigi kooc'i misho tmeetwok'o taash wotitwo ibi kaashitwoki moo aawne?› etfe erere. <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Bíwere dadri abaatse fa'o k'aniyetsonat es'k'rets maa gawno itsh kitsitwe, manoke taash k'aniwere.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>B́ danif gitwots manoke kesht kitu maants bo ami, arikon Iyesus ettsok'on daatsbodek'i. Fazigi kooc' mishono manoke bok'aniyi.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Datso b́ ílere tatse gitwotsnton towat b́weyi, <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Dub. 41:9</ref> </char></note> Marats t'int bo maafe Iyesus «Aroniye itsh tietiri, itítsi ikoniye taan beshide imetwe, bíwere and taanton kooc'misho mooke b́ fa'oniye,» bí et.<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Bowere keewanatse tuutson shiyanat «Taan wotifa nietirwoni?» Etfetst tar taron boaati.<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Iyesusu hank'owa boosh bí et, «Ashmaniye it tatse gitwotsitse wottso iko and taanton s'awotse ito itdek'irwoniye, <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Ash Na'o shin shin b́ jango guut'etsok'on k'iromaand bí amo oreratse, ernmó Ash Na'o beshide imetú ashmansh indowe bísha! ashmaniye balor shin shuweraniyere b́ oorink'e k'anefe!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">No doonz kooc' mishi jango b́need'its nemo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk'. 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 K'or. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Bo móóke bo befere Iyesus misho k'aawdek't b́ deeri, tiitsdek'tnwere b́ danifwotssh «Nahere, han t meetsoniye» et boosh b́ ími.<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Úshi wanc'ono k'a'ú dek't Ik'o údt boosh b́ ími, jamwotsu úshets waanc'otse bo úshi. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kesh. 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erm. 31:31-34</ref> </char></note> Hank'owere boosh bíeti, «Han aywotssh kuud'it handron taareyosh wotitwo t s'atsoniye. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Arikoniye itsh ti'etirii, Ik'i mengitotse k'osh aron aani handr weyinyo túshfetso weyiniyi shuwatse fis'etsan aani úyatse.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Maniyere il Ik'i duubo duubt Debrezeyt guro maants bo keshi.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'eros bín halitwok'o Iyesus shino b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk'. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zek. 13:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus b́ danifwotssh hank'owa bí et « ‹Jinirwono jod'de úd'itwe, mererwotswere bad'itúúne,› et guut'etsotse it únetswor taash bín danatsone etetute, tiyatsnowere shuuts aanitute, taan k'ayr wos'etute, <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat. 28:16</ref> </char></note> Ernmó k'irotse t twiyakon Gelil maants shino beshar ametuwe.»<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Manoor P'et'ros «K'oshwots bo jamets neen bohaliyalor, taa b́jamon neen haaleratse!» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Iyesuswere «Ariko neesh etirwe, hambets t'úwaanitse baako gitoto b́k'adfetsere shino nee keezoto tjangosh, jamere taa bíndanatse etetune,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>P'et'rosmó «K'ir b́wotiyal dab́ neentoni tk'iriti bako jamon neen danatse eraatse!» et kup'i dek't b́ keewi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">B́ danif k'oshwotsu mank'o bo etfera botesh.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Getesemanen Ik'o b́ k'ontsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk'. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Maniyere hakon Getesemaneyi eteets beyokok boami, Iyesus b́ danifwotssh, «Taa ekewoke Ik'o tk'onfere it hanok betere,» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>B́ shutsats P'et'rosna, Yak'obnat Yohansno dek't bí ami, manokno ayidek't shiyanefetst kic'o dek'b́tuwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Hank'owo boosh bí eti, «T kashu k'írosh bborfetso shiyanwtsere, hanoke be teere, err kup'arr korere.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Boyere muk'i okaan wokdek't k'azbiami, datsats b́baron gup'gup'dek't faleetk b́wotiyal sa'at man b́beshitwok'o Ik'o b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Hank'o bí eti, «Nihono, keew jamo neesh falefe, gond bek' úshi wanc'ani tiatse wokiwe, ernmó nee n shuntsok'owa bako taa t shuntsok'o wotk'aye.»<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>B́ danif keezwotsok aanat b́waatsok'on, k'eewwtsat bobefere b́ daatsi, mansh P'et'rossh «Simo'ono, k'eeniya nwtsi? Dab ik sa'atune beyo nmaawi?» bí eti. <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>«Fadeyi kic'ots it kindrawok'owe kup'ar Ik'o k'onwere, Shayironiye k'anke, meetsonmó maawke,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Aaninu amt, enéé bí ettsmank'o et aani Ik'o b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Ando aanat b́ woor, bo aawotse tokro mangt b́ teshtsosh tokrat bobefere, b́ daatsi, bísh bokeewirwono danatsno bo tesh.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Keezlo aanat bomaand waat hank'o boosh bí eti, «Andoor it k'eetsok'oonya it fa'oni? Andoor kashdek'oke it fa'o? Ando bodre! sa'ato bodwtsree! hambe! Ash Na'o morretswots kishats beshide'er imetwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Eshe tuuwere! amone! taan beshide imetwo hamb t'inre!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́detseyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk'. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Manóór Iyesus man b́keewfere tatsegitwotsitsi iko wottso Yhud waa b́keshi, bíntonu gumbonat shiki goradon detsdek'ts ash aywots fa'ano bo tesh, boowere kahni naashwotsitse, Muse nemo danifwotsitse, eenashwotsokno woshekno bo teshi. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Bín beshi de'er imetwo Yihud, «It it detsetiye taa jamó aatr t joobitwoniye, bíne t'iwintsde deshde ameree,» et boosh milikito ímtni b́tesh.<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Yihud manoor wáát Iyesusok t'índek't «Danifono!» et bín b́ joobi. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Maniyere il ash ashuwots Iyesusi detsbodek'i. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Manoke ned'irwotsitse Iyesus shuuts sha'efwotsitse iko b́ shiki gorado kishdek't kahnyi naasho guutso waazo k'ut'b́k'ri. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Iyesus hank'owa boosh bí et, «Shiki goradonat gumbon dek'at it wáá taan wonbadewok'o detsoshe? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk'. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref> </char></note> Aaw aawon Ik'i mootse itn danifetsat itnton tbewor taan deshatste b́ teshi, ernmó han b́wotiye S'ayin mas'afwotsitsi keewetso b́s'eenetwok'owe.»<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>B́danifwots bojamets bín k'azt bowos'i.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Ket'i mitoon wozets nat'al mec'r tahtso jawets na'a iko s'uz Iyesus shuutso shoydek't amiruwe b́tesh, ashuwots bín dets bodek'or <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>B́nat'alu juuk'rat araatson wos'fere k'az bíami.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi mooshi jooro shinats b́dametsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat. 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk'. 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Iyesusmó kahni naasho gal dekt boami, manoke kahni naashwots, eenashwotsnat Muse Nemo danif jamwots kakwe bowtsi. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>P'et'roswere kahnyi naasho mook b́ bodfetso wokdek't Iyesus shuutso bí amfera b́teshi. Manoknowere guuts guutswotsnton bedek't tawo b́ kashfere b́ teshi. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Kahniwots naash naashwotsna, moosh moshyf jamwots, Iyesusi úd'iyosh gaw wotitwo bogefere botesh, ernmó daatsratsno. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Aaywotsu kooton bíats gawerno, b́woteferor bo gawor bo keewo ik woteraniyere b́ oori.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Ik ikwots tuut hank'o et kooto bí ats bogawi, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref> </char></note> «Taa ash kishon ageets Ik'i maa han gaahde keez aawotse k'osho ash kishon finerawo agetwe ett b́keewfre shishrone.» <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Manbwotiyalor bo gawts gawo ik woteratse.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Kahni naashonúwre bo taalotse need'dek't, «Eegor aaniyalkneneya? Ashaanots ni'ats bo t'intsiru s'aamiyo eebi b́ naaroni?» ett Iyesusi bí aati.<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Iyesusmó s'k eta bí eti bako eegor aaniratse. Kahni naashmanwere «Deerets Ik'o Na'o Krstos neeneya?» ett aani bí aati.<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere «Ee, taane, ash Na'o Ik'o k'ani aaro maantse b́befere bek'etute! ando aani daaratse daawnon aanar b́woor bek'etute» <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Kahni naashonwere nibk'unon b́ taho gaat't «K'osh gawo eegoshe b́geyiti? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lew. 24:16</ref> </char></note> Hambe! Ik'o b́c'ashirwok'onoor shishrte, eshe eege itsh bíari?» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Jametswots ik wotdek't «K'iro bísh wotitwe!» et bí ats boangshi. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Ik ikwotswere bo s'udo bí ats s'udo dek't bo tuwi, bí aawono shemoon p'uuridek't «Nee nebiyi nwotiyal aab neen kon b́ jot'tsok'ó dane!» etfetst kishi t'umon bo jot'fere botesh. K'oshwotswere jabefere dek't bo ami.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros Iyesusi b́haltsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat. 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk'. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>P'et'ros kahni naasho mooniye dashe b́ kas'otse b́befere kahniwotsitsi k'aabo gon iku waa b́ keshi, <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Bi P'et'ros tawo b́kashefere bek'aat t'iwintsdek' s'iilat «Neewor Nazrettso Iyesusntonye n teshi,» bísh bi et.<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Bímo «Taa danatse, eebi ni'eetirwoni,» ett bíhaali. Manówere et fengesho maants b́ keshtsok'on baako b́ k'adi.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Gonunwere P'et'rosi bek'aat manoke ned'irwotssh «Hanwor bo jirotsitske!» etaat aani keewo dek' btwi, <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Bímó aani jamere taa bín danatse bí eti. Muk'i boteshiyakon manoke need'iru ashuwots P'et'rossh «Gelil dats ash n wottsok'o n noon keew keewo kitsirwe, manshe arikon neehe bo jirwotsits neene» bo et.<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Bímó «It etiru ash han taa danatse!» etfetst taart bí atso b́c'ashi.<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Manoor baako gitlo b́ k'adi, P'et'roswere «Baako gitoto b́k'adfetsere, keezoto taan jamere bín danatse etetune,» et Iyesus b́ keewtso keewo bísh gawe b́wtsere ay dek't bí'eepi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus P'ilat'os shinats b́t'íntsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk'. 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Guur dats b́gatstson kahni naashwots, eenashwotsnton, Muse nemo danifwotsnton, moosh mooshif jametswotsnton boshiyeyi, maniyere il Iyesusi típdek' amt P'ílat'ossh beshi dek't ím bok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>P'ilat'os «Ayhudiy nugúso neeneya?» ett bíaati. Iyesuswere «Nee niettsok'oyiye,» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Kahni naashwotsmó Iyesusi ay dek'tni bo s'aamifere bo tesh. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Mansh P'ilat'os «S'iile! ambts keewon neen bos'aamirwok'ona! b́jamon eegor ni'aanitwo deshatsiya?» ett aani bíaati.<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>P'ilat'os bí'adfetsosh andoor Iyesus egoŕ aaniratse.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats b́k'iritwok'o angshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk'. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoh. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>P'ilat'os worwot worwoton Ayhudi fazigi woroti baalyots ashuwots boosh b́bitsetwok'o bo'aatts tipitsi ash iko boosh biitsfe b́ tesh. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Manóór mengstats tuut datso s'eezits, asho úd't tipi moots kindtswots fa'ano botesh, manotsitsno iko Berbani eteef ashoni b́tesh. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Ash ashuwotswere P'ilat'os maants t'int bodantsok'on boosh b́k'alish bín bok'oni. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Bíwere «Ayhudí nugúso biishde itsh tfaksho geefteya?» ett boon bí'aati. <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Han bí'etirwere kahni naashwots Iyesusi beshidek't boímir okooron b́ wottsok'o b́dantsotsna b́tesh.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Kahni naashwots, «B́ shegro Berban noosh biitsewa,» err P'ilat'osi bok'onitwok'o ashuwotsi tuuz bok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>P'ilat'oswere, «Béré, ayhudi nugúsa it etirwan aak'o k'aluta?» ett ashuwotsi aani bí aati.<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Bowere «Bín jiire!» etfetst aani bokuhi. <verse eid="MRK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>P'ilat'oswere «Eegishe? Eege bí aawashits keewoní?» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Bowere «Bín jiire!» etfetst aydek't bo kuhi.<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>P'ilat'os ashuwotsi gene'ushosha ett Berbani bitsdek't boosh faksh b́k'ri, Iyesusnmó jot't b́jiitetwok'ó beshidek't imb́kri.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kes' kes'fuwots Iyesusats tirgic'o bokashtsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat. 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Kes' kes'irwots Iyesusi datsu keewirwo múúlok dek't bo ami, oorts kes' kes'iru jamwotsno bo s'eegi, <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Tah birono bísh takbok'ri, angitso k'odetso wozdek't b́ tookats gúp'sh bok'ri, <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>«Ayhudi nugúsono aage! Jeeno neesh wotowe!» etfetst bíats kashfetst jamo bín bo'aatfere botesh. <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Guumbono b́ tookats bo togfere botesh, s'údono bíats s'udfetst tirgic'o bíats kashfetst tuk'maldek't b́ gubrats bo sagadfere botesh. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Bí'ats bokashihakon tah bíro kishbazt, b́took taho takbok'ri, jitosho bín dekt boami.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́jiitetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-44">Mar. 14:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk'. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Amoke bobefere K'eren dats ash wotts Iskndriyosnat Rufosn nih Sm'on gat'ariyon waat kitots b́ kindfere daats bodek'i, Iyesus mask'aliyo angnon b́kuritwok'o bowoshi. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Maniyerehakon Iyesusi b́bitso took k'ola eteets beewoko Golgotók dek't boami. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Manokno kerbewonton eeketso weyini biro b́ úshetwok'o boimi, eree bímó úyatse. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Dub. 22:18</ref> </char></note> Maniyere hakon jitbok'ri, b́tahwotsnó kon aawi b́dek'etwok'o it'o shap't kaybodek'i. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Iyesusi bo jitor datso guur keez sa'ata b́ teshi. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>B́ t'afiyo kiitsoshowere «Ayhudi nugúsa» ett guut'etso guut'k'reyi. <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Gond finets gitetswotsi dek' waat Iyesusnton iko k'ano maants ikono b́giromaants jit bok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref> </char></note> Mank'onowere «Gond fintswotsnton b́ taaweyi,» ett keewetso b́ s'eenetwok'wa.<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:7">Luk'. 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">Dub. 109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar. 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref> </char>
    </note> B́ganoke beshefetst teshts ashuwotsi gac'on botoko shek'efetst hank'o ett bín boc'ashfere botesh, «Indowe neená! nee Ik'i moo gaahr keez aawotse aak'ritwono! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Aab́ and jitatse ood'ŕ ntooko kashiwe!»<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Mank'oon kahni naashwotsnat Muse nemo danifwotsn bo atsatsewo hank'o ett bíats trgc'o bokaashi. «K'oshwotsi kashire, b́tokonmóó kashiyo falratse! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Bí Krstosi Israe'el Nugusoni wotiyal bére aab and jitatse ood'e, noowere be'er bín amanone!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Mank'o bínton jitetswots wonbedewotswere bín boc'ashfere botesh.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'iro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk'. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Aaw shrt sa'aton tuut jed'i sa'ato b́borfetso dats jamatse t'alwo wotb́wtsí. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Dub. 22:1</ref> </char></note> Jed'i sa'at b́wottsok'on Iyesus «Elohe, elohe, lama sebek'tani,» ett k'áári eenon b́ kuhi. Mank'o etonwere «T Ik'ono, t Ik'ono! eegishe taan k'aznk'ri?» eta.<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Manoke need'at teshts ashuwotsitse ik ikwots b́ kuho shisht «Hambe! Eliyasiye b́ s'eegiri,» bo eti. <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Dub. 69:21</ref> </char></note> Boyitsi iko wos't weyni biri shasho s'olok'o s'aamo spoonjiwots<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sponjiya: </char><char style="ft">Aatso b́ gitsomaants múús'fo wee k'ac'ono bín firek naara. </char></note> gupdek't s'entsb́k'ri, b́ úshetwok'owere gumbats ged dek't Iyesussh imt «Aab Eliyas wáár bín oorshitewe woto s'iilone!» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Maniyehakon Iyesus k'áári eenon b́kuuhi, b́ kashunwe bí aatsotse k'az bkeshi.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Ik' mootsi magarajiyo dambe dek't dash b́borfetsó gaad'at́ gitok kayb́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>B́maask'aly shinatse eed' dek't́ teshts bali naasho Iyesus kasho bíatsotse aawk'on b́ keshtsok'o t'iwints dek' b́ bek'tsok'on, «Ash han arikon Ik'o naayiye bíteshi» bí eti.<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Golgotatse teshts mááts máátsuwotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mat. 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-27">Yoh. 19:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Wokoon wotdek't s'iliru mááts ik ikwotswere manoke fa'ano botesh. Boyitsnó Megdel datstsu Mariyamu, muk'efo Yak'obnat Yosa ind Maryamu, Selomewwere fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:41 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:2-3">8:2-3</ref> </char></note> Bowere Iyesus Galiln b́ teshor, b́ shuutso sha'aŕ bísha bo finefo. Mank'owere Iyesusok Iyerusalem maantse waats aywots fa'ano botesh.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi duketsok'oó</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Datso ilat b́teshtsotse sanbati kindi aawonat k'andek'i aawonowere b́ woti. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Manoró Ayhudi moosh moshifwotsitse iko teshtso Yosefi eteefo, mangiyets Armatiyas asho b́ weyi. Bíwere Ik'imengsto kotirw asha b́tesh. Bíwere b́sharawo P'ilat'os shinats t'int Iyesus duuno bísh b́ ímish b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>P'ilat'oswere «Aak'oneya hank'o káári b́k'iri» ett bí adi. Bali abaatse naashonó s'eegit́ «Arikon b́ k'iriyako ja'ará?» ett bíaati. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Iyesus k'iro bali abaatse naasho atse b́ shishihakon duuno b́ dek'etwok'o Yosefsh bí eeki. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yosef duuni shemo keewdek't mask'aliyatse Iyesus duuno orshdek't k'od b́k'ri, s'alatse k'ewdek't k'aniyets doowots duk b́k'ri. Shúts eeno kukulshdek' doowo ipbok'ri. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Megdelawi eteetsu Mariyamnat Yosá ind Mariyamń Iyesusi eewk duketsok'o bos'iilfera botesh.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'irotse b́ tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk'. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Sanbati aawo b́beshi hakon Megdelawi kititstsu Mariyam, Yak'ob ind Mariyamnat Selomen wotat́, Iyesus duunats fuutosh shitúwo keew bo dek'i. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Ik gawyotsi shints aaw wotts sanbat eenots guur t'úwon, aawu keshfere bwoor, doowo maants bo ami. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Bo «Shútso doowi nonatse konek'uwa noosh kukulshiti?» etfetst keewefere bo amir. <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Manowere bo etir doowo bín ipets shútso ayidek't een b́ teshtsosha, kááwdek't bo s'iilnmó shútso ik maants kukulwtsat́ b́befere bo bek'i. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Doowotso bo kindor shemi nas' tahirwo jawetso k'anomaantse b́ befere bobek'tsotse tek'bowtsi.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Bímó boosh hank'owa bí et «Tek'k'ayere! it it geyirwo jitt teshetso Nazrettso Iyesusi b́ wottsok'o danfee, bí k'az tuure, hanoke aaliye, b́duukeyokonúwere hambe s'iilere. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat. 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar. 14:28</ref> </char></note> Andoor ameree, b́ danifwotsnat P'et'rosnsh, ‹Haniyere shin Iyesus itsh b́ keewutsok'on bí Gelil maants itiyre shinar ametuwe, manokno bín bek'etute,› err boosh keewwere.»<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Máátswotswere shatoon k'ewefetst doowi ganoke kesht k'azbo'ami, ayidek't́ shatt boteshtsotse ik keewo konshor keewratsnó.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Iyesus megdela kititsttsu Mariyamsh b́ be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoh. 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Ik gawiyotse shints aawots Sanbata gudots Iyesus guuron k'irotse b́ tuwi hakon, shin shino shawat fo'erawo biyatse b́kishtsu Megdela eteef kititstsu Mariyamsh b́be'eyi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Biwere amaat, shiyanon eepoke fa'ua b́shuuts sha'efwotssh keew bk'ri. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Biwere «Iyesus k'irotse tuut, kashon fa'ee, taawor ti ááwon bek're,» etaat boosh b keewi, ernmó boowor bin amaneratsno.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ danif gituwotssh b́ be'ewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk'. 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Maniyere hakon gat'ariyomants amfetst teshts b́ danif gitwotssh Iyesus k'osh aron b́ be'e. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Bowere aanat b́danif oortswotssh keewbokri, ernmó manotsnor amaneratsno.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus wosheets tatse ikuwotssh b́be'ewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk'. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Wosh. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Maniyere hakon tatse ikwots mishimarats t'int́ bomaafere Iyesus bo ats be'eeb́wtsi, «Iyesus k'irotse tuut kashon fa'ee no ááwono bek'rone,» ett boosh keewtswotsi aman bo k'aztsona et bo nib kup'osh boon b́k'efi. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Wosh. 1:8</ref> </char></note> Hank'owa boosh bíet, «Dats jik' jamats ameree, ash jamoosho doo shishiyo daniwere. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Amantsonat guupetson kashitwe, amanerawonmó bí ats angshetwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Taan amanitu jamwots adits keewanotsi finituno, t shúútson fo'erawo kishituuno, handr noon keew keewonowere keewituuno, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Dawunzwotsi bodetsalo, wee úd'it merziyo dab́ bo úshal eegor boon k'alratse, bo kishono shodtswotsats bo gedor shodtswotś kashitune.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus daro maants b́dek'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk'. 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Wosh. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Wosh. 1:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzo Iyesus jaman boosh b́keewiyhakon daromaand k'az bíami. Ik'o k'ani aaromants be b́wtsi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>B́ danifwotswere dats jamatse sha'at́ bo daniyi, doonzonúwere bonton b́ finefoni. Adits finono bo k'alitwok'o alo boosh ímt bo daniyru man ar b́wottsok'o b́ kup'shfoni.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
